1
00:00:05,005 --> 00:00:07,140
[♪ theme music playing]

2
00:00:16,016 --> 00:00:19,953
{\an8}[narrator] <i>The winner of</i> I Am Boxer <i>will
receive a grand prize of 300 million</i>

3
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:23,156
{\an8}- <i>and a top-of-the-line flagship SUV.</i>
- [♪ upbeat music playing]

4
00:00:26,026 --> 00:00:28,028
[♪ tense music playing]

5
00:00:29,696 --> 00:00:33,867
Hello, I'm Kuk Seungjun
from the Hwasun County boxing team.

6
00:00:33,934 --> 00:00:36,403
My name is Lee Chaehyun,
and I'm with the KAFAC.

7
00:00:36,970 --> 00:00:38,171
Salute!

8
00:00:38,238 --> 00:00:40,240
There are a few fighters here I'm wary of.

9
00:00:40,307 --> 00:00:41,308
{\an8}Lee Chaehyun, for one.

10
00:00:41,375 --> 00:00:43,043
{\an8}[spectators clamoring]

11
00:00:43,110 --> 00:00:44,311
[contestant 1] Nice slip and rip!

12
00:00:44,378 --> 00:00:45,512
{\an8}Great, he's fast.

13
00:00:45,579 --> 00:00:46,980
{\an8}THE OUTBOXER
WHO CAUGHT DON LEE'S EYE

14
00:00:47,047 --> 00:00:48,549
{\an8}WIN AGAINST AN AMERICAN BOXER

15
00:00:48,615 --> 00:00:50,617
- He ate that counter head-on!
- [clamoring continues]

16
00:00:51,285 --> 00:00:52,352
Down, down, down!

17
00:00:52,920 --> 00:00:54,388
{\an8}WIN AGAINST AN MMA FIGHTER

18
00:00:54,454 --> 00:00:56,356
[Seungjun] <i>He was just so good.</i>

19
00:00:56,423 --> 00:00:58,825
I'll show you
what textbook boxing looks like.

20
00:00:58,892 --> 00:00:59,927
[contestant] He's super fast.

21
00:00:59,993 --> 00:01:01,361
{\an8}FIGHT 3
WIN AGAINST A SUPER HEAVYWEIGHT

22
00:01:01,428 --> 00:01:03,330
- [clamoring continues]
- <i>He was on another level.</i>

23
00:01:03,397 --> 00:01:06,033
<i>He's experienced and composed.</i>

24
00:01:06,600 --> 00:01:10,170
{\an8}A WELL-ROUNDED BOXER RECOGNIZED
BY WORLD CHAMPION BIVOL

25
00:01:10,237 --> 00:01:12,205
I want that <i>I Am Boxer</i> champion belt.

26
00:01:13,073 --> 00:01:14,174
{\an8}QUARTERFINALS TO SEMIFINALS

27
00:01:14,241 --> 00:01:15,375
{\an8}<i>This is my turn to shine.</i>

28
00:01:15,442 --> 00:01:16,743
- <i>This is my stage.</i>
- [chanting]

29
00:01:16,810 --> 00:01:18,245
[Chaehyun] <i>I was getting fired up.</i>

30
00:01:18,912 --> 00:01:20,581
{\an8}QUARTERFINALS
WIN AGAINST A GHANAIAN BOXER

31
00:01:20,647 --> 00:01:23,817
{\an8}[Seungheon] Lee Chaehyun has
a really solid, well-rounded skill set.

32
00:01:23,884 --> 00:01:25,819
{\an8}[Gyuwon] He's a naturally gifted boxer.

33
00:01:25,886 --> 00:01:29,656
Honestly, I don't think
I paid much attention to Kuk Seungjun.

34
00:01:30,257 --> 00:01:32,125
[contestant 1] <i>I bet he got cast
for his looks.</i>

35
00:01:32,693 --> 00:01:33,894
[contestant 2] This is insane!

36
00:01:33,961 --> 00:01:34,962
His eyes changed.

37
00:01:35,028 --> 00:01:37,130
Once he steps into the ring,
he's a different person.

38
00:01:37,998 --> 00:01:39,299
{\an8}This is straight out of a movie.

39
00:01:39,366 --> 00:01:40,367
<i>He can fight, sure.</i>

40
00:01:40,434 --> 00:01:41,735
But I wasn't that worried.

41
00:01:42,235 --> 00:01:45,439
[Dex] He's not pressing
like he did last round.

42
00:01:45,505 --> 00:01:47,874
[Seungjun] <i>I kept thinking,
"What if I lose?"</i>

43
00:01:47,941 --> 00:01:49,843
I wasn't very confident to begin with.

44
00:01:49,910 --> 00:01:51,111
[♪ melancholy music playing]

45
00:01:51,178 --> 00:01:52,913
[Seungjun] <i>I'm not happy
with my performance.</i>

46
00:01:52,980 --> 00:01:54,815
<i>I fought so badly.</i>

47
00:01:54,881 --> 00:01:56,817
<i>Round 3 didn't sit right with me either.</i>

48
00:01:56,883 --> 00:01:58,585
<i>I'd lost confidence in myself.</i>

49
00:01:58,652 --> 00:02:00,754
<i>I think that shook me mentally.</i>

50
00:02:00,821 --> 00:02:02,756
[Lee] The survivor of this match is

51
00:02:02,823 --> 00:02:04,591
Lee Gijun from the blue corner.

52
00:02:05,359 --> 00:02:07,361
<i>Then I thought, "I need to step it up."</i>

53
00:02:08,962 --> 00:02:10,263
<i>"If I want to get stronger,"</i>

54
00:02:10,330 --> 00:02:13,266
<i>"I have to believe in myself
and fight with confidence."</i>

55
00:02:13,333 --> 00:02:15,102
{\an8}[Seungheon] It's Kuk Seungjun!

56
00:02:15,168 --> 00:02:18,438
He drew attention early on
because of his looks,

57
00:02:18,505 --> 00:02:20,741
but he's now considered
the most improved fighter.

58
00:02:21,274 --> 00:02:23,210
[exclaims] <i>I'm going to go all out.</i>

59
00:02:23,977 --> 00:02:24,978
And nice body shot!

60
00:02:25,045 --> 00:02:26,680
{\an8}- Kuk is going for it!
- [spectators clamoring]

61
00:02:26,747 --> 00:02:28,415
{\an8}[Gyuwon] This is
a chance for Kuk Seungjun!

62
00:02:28,482 --> 00:02:29,883
The winner is...

63
00:02:29,950 --> 00:02:31,585
Kuk Seungjun.

64
00:02:32,085 --> 00:02:33,453
- ...Kuk Seungjun.
- [spectators cheering]

65
00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:36,456
- [applause]
- [exclaims]

66
00:02:37,924 --> 00:02:41,028
{\an8}THE EVER-EVOLVING INFIGHTER,
BODY KILLER KUK SEUNGJUN

67
00:02:41,094 --> 00:02:42,362
Certainly!

68
00:02:44,131 --> 00:02:45,999
[Seungheon] It's the finals of <i>I Am Boxer</i>!

69
00:02:46,066 --> 00:02:49,169
[Lee] A new champion will be crowned
here today!

70
00:02:49,236 --> 00:02:51,872
[Chaehyun] <i>I'd say I'm
a step ahead technically.</i>

71
00:02:51,938 --> 00:02:53,473
<i>There's not much between us anyway.</i>

72
00:02:53,540 --> 00:02:55,008
<i>I believe I can edge out a win.</i>

73
00:02:55,075 --> 00:02:56,576
- [♪ upbeat music playing]
- Box!

74
00:02:56,643 --> 00:02:57,844
[bell dings]

75
00:02:57,911 --> 00:02:59,613
- [Seungheon] Nice body shot!
- [Dex] That landed!

76
00:03:00,313 --> 00:03:02,149
[Gyuwon] That's a dangerous punch
from Kuk Seungjun!

77
00:03:02,215 --> 00:03:03,717
[spectator 1] Let's go, Chaehyun!

78
00:03:03,784 --> 00:03:06,353
- That's veteran savvy from Lee Chaehyun!
- [spectators clamoring]

79
00:03:06,420 --> 00:03:09,256
- [spectator 2] That's it!
- This really feels like the finals.

80
00:03:09,322 --> 00:03:10,791
{\an8}- [Dex] Come on, let's go!
- [Lee] Keep throwing!

81
00:03:10,857 --> 00:03:12,225
{\an8}OUTBOXING ALL-ROUNDER
VS EVOLVING INFIGHTER

82
00:03:12,292 --> 00:03:13,894
The blockbuster boxing survival show.

83
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:15,529
<i>I Am Boxer.</i>

84
00:03:15,595 --> 00:03:19,366
- [Jongkook] The champion is...
- [bell dings]

85
00:03:20,267 --> 00:03:22,602
[♪ playful music playing]

86
00:03:26,673 --> 00:03:28,275
Ever been to Apgujeong?

87
00:03:28,341 --> 00:03:30,577
No, actually, this is my first time.

88
00:03:30,644 --> 00:03:32,045
- Really?
- Yes.

89
00:03:32,112 --> 00:03:34,014
- You country bumpkin. [chuckles]
- [chuckles]

90
00:03:34,081 --> 00:03:35,849
Hey, hold on... [chuckling]

91
00:03:35,916 --> 00:03:38,185
We're just hanging out.
What's with the military uniform?

92
00:03:39,619 --> 00:03:40,887
[chuckles]

93
00:03:41,755 --> 00:03:42,823
[sighs]

94
00:03:42,889 --> 00:03:44,357
- Here they come.
- [chuckles]

95
00:03:44,424 --> 00:03:46,660
- [contestant 1 clamors]
- [contestant 2 clamors, chuckles]

96
00:03:47,227 --> 00:03:49,296
{\an8}PARK YOUNGHO,
KIM HYUNJUN, CHO HYUNJAE

97
00:03:49,362 --> 00:03:50,964
{\an8}Why fight? Just do rock-paper-scissors.

98
00:03:51,031 --> 00:03:52,032
{\an8}HONG SUNGMIN, YUK JUNSEO

99
00:03:52,099 --> 00:03:54,367
Let me explain why we're here today.

100
00:03:54,434 --> 00:03:57,137
With the finals coming up,
I know you've been grinding nonstop.

101
00:03:57,204 --> 00:03:58,805
So today, in Apgujeong,

102
00:03:58,872 --> 00:04:01,742
- let's have some fun, relax,
- [Sungmin] Yep.

103
00:04:01,808 --> 00:04:03,577
- [Youngho] and recharge.
- [contestant] Let's go.

104
00:04:04,778 --> 00:04:07,114
Seungjun totally looks
like he belongs here.

105
00:04:07,180 --> 00:04:08,949
- Right?
- And you've never been here before?

106
00:04:09,015 --> 00:04:10,450
[Sungmin] He looks like a local.

107
00:04:11,318 --> 00:04:14,187
First stop, the arcade.

108
00:04:14,254 --> 00:04:16,022
- All right!
- Sounds good.

109
00:04:16,089 --> 00:04:18,992
So, can we expect
a punching machine showdown today?

110
00:04:19,059 --> 00:04:20,527
- [exclaims]
- [Hyunjae grunts]

111
00:04:20,594 --> 00:04:22,696
- [♪ upbeat music playing]
- Let's do it. Just us this time.

112
00:04:24,464 --> 00:04:25,766
- This is it.
- Wow.

113
00:04:25,832 --> 00:04:27,100
[exclaims]

114
00:04:27,167 --> 00:04:29,903
[Junseo] Take it easy, guys. No pressure.

115
00:04:34,107 --> 00:04:35,408
- Hey, Seungjun!
- Nice one!

116
00:04:35,475 --> 00:04:36,843
Look at the puck, Seungjun!

117
00:04:36,910 --> 00:04:39,112
- I can't!
- [Sungmin] Work on your tracking, man!

118
00:04:39,179 --> 00:04:40,847
[Hyunjae] Eyes on the puck!

119
00:04:40,914 --> 00:04:42,983
- [exclaims]
- [chuckles]

120
00:04:43,049 --> 00:04:44,818
[Youngho] That thing's
practically calling us.

121
00:04:44,885 --> 00:04:46,086
Yeah, the punching machine.

122
00:04:47,854 --> 00:04:50,190
At last, the main event of the day.

123
00:04:50,857 --> 00:04:53,894
- How about a little taste of the finals?
- [contestants exclaim]

124
00:04:53,960 --> 00:04:56,563
{\an8}Seungjun versus Chaehyun.

125
00:04:56,630 --> 00:04:58,398
{\an8}A little pre-fight event.

126
00:04:58,465 --> 00:04:59,900
- [laughs]
- [contestants exclaim]

127
00:04:59,966 --> 00:05:00,967
[contestant] Okay, sure.

128
00:05:01,034 --> 00:05:02,035
Sounds fun.

129
00:05:02,102 --> 00:05:04,104
[contestants clamor]

130
00:05:04,171 --> 00:05:06,173
[clamoring, chattering]

131
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:08,708
- To the camera. Turn around.
- [chuckles]

132
00:05:08,775 --> 00:05:09,776
No, keep going, man!

133
00:05:09,843 --> 00:05:11,745
{\an8}- All right, there you go!
- [♪ upbeat music playing]

134
00:05:11,812 --> 00:05:13,180
{\an8}ALL-AROUND OUTBOXER,
PRINCE LEE CHAEHYUN

135
00:05:13,246 --> 00:05:14,714
{\an8}Nice. That's it.

136
00:05:14,781 --> 00:05:15,816
Seungjun, your turn.

137
00:05:15,882 --> 00:05:18,318
Show him what you've got, man.

138
00:05:18,885 --> 00:05:22,856
{\an8}EVER-EVOLVING INFIGHTER
BODY KILLER KUK SEUNGJUN

139
00:05:23,490 --> 00:05:25,892
[contestant] All right, fair enough.
Let's give him an A for effort.

140
00:05:27,661 --> 00:05:28,795
You up for this?

141
00:05:28,862 --> 00:05:30,063
Let's make it a real bet.

142
00:05:30,564 --> 00:05:32,299
- Loser buys dinner.
- Dinner?

143
00:05:32,365 --> 00:05:33,934
- [clamors]
- How does that sound? Deal?

144
00:05:34,968 --> 00:05:36,269
- Deal.
- [contestants laughing]

145
00:05:36,336 --> 00:05:39,439
- You sure military pay can cover that?
- Prices around here are no joke, though.

146
00:05:39,506 --> 00:05:41,308
{\an8}[Youngho] Loser buys dinner. Deal?

147
00:05:41,374 --> 00:05:42,776
{\an8}- Deal?
- Okay, deal.

148
00:05:42,843 --> 00:05:44,778
My punching power's gone up these days.

149
00:05:44,845 --> 00:05:45,879
I mean for real.

150
00:05:45,946 --> 00:05:48,448
- Okay, go, go, go.
- I'll hit on 10.

151
00:05:48,515 --> 00:05:50,450
- [♪ tense music playing]
- My palms are all sweaty.

152
00:05:50,517 --> 00:05:51,651
[Youngho] Load up and go!

153
00:05:51,718 --> 00:05:52,752
[contestants clamor]

154
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:55,455
- [contestant 1 exclaims]
- [contestants clamor]

155
00:05:55,522 --> 00:05:57,524
[exclaiming]

156
00:05:59,125 --> 00:06:01,161
{\an8}MYUNG HYUNMAN: 9,291 POINTS

157
00:06:01,228 --> 00:06:03,797
- All right, whenever you're ready...
- [Dex exclaims]

158
00:06:04,397 --> 00:06:06,099
[contestants cheering]

159
00:06:06,166 --> 00:06:08,668
{\an8}KIM MINUK: 9,367 POINTS

160
00:06:10,604 --> 00:06:12,272
- Load up and go!
- [exclaim]

161
00:06:12,339 --> 00:06:14,074
- You hit the side.
- That was a bit off.

162
00:06:14,641 --> 00:06:16,409
[contestant] All right!

163
00:06:16,943 --> 00:06:18,044
{\an8}LEE CHAEHYUN: 9,537 POINTS

164
00:06:18,111 --> 00:06:19,112
{\an8}For real?

165
00:06:19,179 --> 00:06:20,881
But 9,500? That's huge.

166
00:06:20,947 --> 00:06:21,948
[Chaehyun] Of course.

167
00:06:22,015 --> 00:06:24,517
- Hold on. Come here.
- Let's take this off first.

168
00:06:25,919 --> 00:06:28,555
- Hey, hey, stop. Not the pants. [laughs]
- [contestants laughing]

169
00:06:28,622 --> 00:06:29,623
Seriously, don't.

170
00:06:30,457 --> 00:06:31,458
[Youngho] Let's do this.

171
00:06:31,524 --> 00:06:32,826
[♪ tense music playing]

172
00:06:32,893 --> 00:06:34,261
- Will he top that?
- Go.

173
00:06:34,961 --> 00:06:37,063
- All right!
- That should beat it.

174
00:06:38,031 --> 00:06:39,399
{\an8}[Youngho] That should beat it.

175
00:06:39,466 --> 00:06:40,567
{\an8}- And he beat it!
- [cheering]

176
00:06:40,634 --> 00:06:42,869
{\an8}LEE CHAEHYUN: 9,537 POINTS
KUK SEUNGJUN: 9,663 POINTS

177
00:06:42,936 --> 00:06:43,970
{\an8}- Wait, but...
- [Seungjun] Hey!

178
00:06:44,037 --> 00:06:46,039
[contestants cheering]

179
00:06:46,106 --> 00:06:47,908
- [laugh]
- [♪ upbeat music playing]

180
00:06:47,974 --> 00:06:50,277
[Junseo] Wait, 9,600?
That's gotta be the top score.

181
00:06:50,343 --> 00:06:51,778
- That's insane.
- It's 9,600.

182
00:06:51,845 --> 00:06:52,946
He's buying, right?

183
00:06:53,013 --> 00:06:55,048
Well, you lost, so dinner's on you.

184
00:06:55,115 --> 00:06:56,249
Fine, I'll buy.

185
00:06:58,018 --> 00:07:01,187
[Junseo] Hey, this is kind of cruel.
Soldiers don't have money.

186
00:07:01,254 --> 00:07:03,156
[Chaehyun] It's okay. I lost.

187
00:07:03,223 --> 00:07:04,391
[♪ playful music playing]

188
00:07:04,457 --> 00:07:05,492
I'm hungry.

189
00:07:05,558 --> 00:07:06,960
Where's good for pizza these days?

190
00:07:07,460 --> 00:07:09,262
- No More P****.
- What... What should we get?

191
00:07:09,763 --> 00:07:11,598
[Hyunjae] I love No More P****.

192
00:07:11,665 --> 00:07:13,767
- Let's get shrimp pizza.
- [Chaehyun] Shrimp?

193
00:07:14,467 --> 00:07:16,870
You two are in the same weight class

194
00:07:16,937 --> 00:07:19,639
- in amateur boxing, right?
- That's right.

195
00:07:19,706 --> 00:07:23,543
So how many times
have you faced each other?

196
00:07:24,044 --> 00:07:26,012
Three times total.

197
00:07:26,079 --> 00:07:27,747
Twice in 2022.

198
00:07:27,814 --> 00:07:29,382
- Once this year. Yes.
- Once this year?

199
00:07:29,449 --> 00:07:31,451
I won twice back then,

200
00:07:31,518 --> 00:07:32,752
and lost the recent one.

201
00:07:33,253 --> 00:07:36,623
So it's two to one.
There's gotta be some rivalry there.

202
00:07:36,690 --> 00:07:38,525
I saw their most recent match.

203
00:07:38,591 --> 00:07:39,592
It was intense.

204
00:07:39,659 --> 00:07:41,628
They were super evenly matched.

205
00:07:41,695 --> 00:07:43,029
[♪ tense music playing]

206
00:07:43,096 --> 00:07:44,097
[contestants grunting]

207
00:07:44,164 --> 00:07:46,266
{\an8}FIRST MATCH - 2022
NATIONAL BOXING CHAMPIONSHIPS

208
00:07:48,668 --> 00:07:51,037
{\an8}LEE CHAEHYUN WON

209
00:07:51,604 --> 00:07:53,773
{\an8}SECOND MATCH,
2022 52ND PRESIDENT'S CUP

210
00:07:53,840 --> 00:07:55,342
{\an8}[Seungjun] <i>Back in college,</i>

211
00:07:55,408 --> 00:08:01,247
<i>I couldn't deal
with Chaehyun's timing and speed.</i>

212
00:08:01,314 --> 00:08:04,184
{\an8}LEE CHAEHYUN WON

213
00:08:05,218 --> 00:08:07,253
<i>But I really wanted to win.</i>

214
00:08:07,320 --> 00:08:08,455
[spectators clamoring]

215
00:08:08,521 --> 00:08:12,058
[Seungjun] <i>So in our most recent match,
I went on the offensive first</i>

216
00:08:12,125 --> 00:08:15,628
<i>and threw him off his rhythm instead.</i>

217
00:08:15,695 --> 00:08:17,998
{\an8}THIRD MATCH,
2025 55TH PRESIDENT'S CUP

218
00:08:18,064 --> 00:08:20,033
{\an8}KUK SEUNGJUN WON

219
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:23,203
[Seungjun] <i>You could say he's my rival.</i>

220
00:08:23,269 --> 00:08:26,539
[Chaehyun] <i>Facing him
on this stage should be fun.</i>

221
00:08:26,606 --> 00:08:29,009
He knows my game, and I know his.

222
00:08:29,509 --> 00:08:32,078
- That's why it's tough. [inhales sharply]
- [contestant grunts]

223
00:08:32,746 --> 00:08:34,114
We know each other too well.

224
00:08:34,180 --> 00:08:36,983
[Junseo] Honestly, it's hard to call.
Both of you are so good.

225
00:08:37,717 --> 00:08:39,819
- This looks good.
- That's a lot of toppings.

226
00:08:39,886 --> 00:08:42,756
[Youngho] Here's to Chaehyun
and Seungjun making the finals!

227
00:08:42,822 --> 00:08:44,657
- Cheers!
- [contestants] Cheers!

228
00:08:45,158 --> 00:08:47,527
We did a lot today.
The arcade, walking around...

229
00:08:47,594 --> 00:08:49,662
That should've burned a ton of calories.

230
00:08:49,729 --> 00:08:51,898
So now it's time to refuel with protein.

231
00:08:51,965 --> 00:08:53,767
- [♪ upbeat music playing]
- [contestants exclaim]

232
00:08:53,833 --> 00:08:55,168
You almost ate the whole thing.

233
00:08:55,235 --> 00:08:56,369
[Seungjun grunts]

234
00:08:56,436 --> 00:09:00,140
- This tastes epic.
- [Youngho] Epic, huh? [laughs]

235
00:09:00,206 --> 00:09:02,575
I love how you can
really bite into the shrimp.

236
00:09:02,642 --> 00:09:04,077
[Hyunjae] This one's my favorite.

237
00:09:04,144 --> 00:09:06,279
Love the corn and shrimp combination.

238
00:09:06,346 --> 00:09:09,182
- Shrimp's packed with protein, so...
- [contestant 2] Yum, so good.

239
00:09:09,749 --> 00:09:13,453
Feels like I blinked
and it's the finals. [inhales sharply]

240
00:09:13,520 --> 00:09:15,955
So many people are cheering for me too.

241
00:09:16,956 --> 00:09:18,458
Give us a fight to remember.

242
00:09:18,525 --> 00:09:22,695
I hope you two
make it a great ending for <i>I Am Boxer</i>.

243
00:09:22,762 --> 00:09:23,863
[♪ tense music playing]

244
00:09:23,930 --> 00:09:25,999
- Let's go!
- Let's go!

245
00:09:26,066 --> 00:09:27,967
- [person] Nine!
- Nine!

246
00:09:30,036 --> 00:09:32,338
- Come on, two more! Just two more!
- [Seungjun breathing heavily]

247
00:09:34,040 --> 00:09:35,208
[person 3] Extend!

248
00:09:35,275 --> 00:09:36,910
[exclaims]

249
00:09:42,382 --> 00:09:43,383
[♪ tense music playing]

250
00:09:43,450 --> 00:09:46,886
[contestant 1] <i>There's a place
that represents every boxer's dream.</i>

251
00:09:47,854 --> 00:09:49,956
It's a dream stage for boxers.

252
00:09:50,023 --> 00:09:51,658
The most famous arena.

253
00:09:51,724 --> 00:09:53,660
[Hyeongbin] <i>It's sacred ground in boxing.</i>

254
00:09:53,726 --> 00:09:57,163
[contestant 2] <i>If you're a boxer,
there's no way you don't know this place.</i>

255
00:09:57,230 --> 00:09:59,833
[Hyunman] <i>It's
the stage you dream about as a kid.</i>

256
00:09:59,899 --> 00:10:02,869
[contestant 3] <i>Every boxer dreams
of fighting there.</i>

257
00:10:02,936 --> 00:10:06,239
It feels surreal
that I'll be fighting here.

258
00:10:06,306 --> 00:10:09,175
So many champions have been crowned here,

259
00:10:09,242 --> 00:10:11,444
and I want to be one of them.

260
00:10:12,011 --> 00:10:15,348
{\an8}FINALS VENUE,
JANGCHUNG ARENA IN SEOUL

261
00:10:26,493 --> 00:10:27,827
I'll give it everything I have.

262
00:10:27,894 --> 00:10:29,395
I'll fight like my life depends on it.

263
00:10:30,396 --> 00:10:33,666
[narrator] <i>It is the long-awaited finals
of</i> I Am Boxer!

264
00:10:33,733 --> 00:10:37,070
<i>Please enjoy the fight
with your loudest cheers!</i>

265
00:10:37,137 --> 00:10:38,805
<i>Please welcome Master Don Lee</i>

266
00:10:38,872 --> 00:10:43,710
- <i>and the hosts Kim Jongkook and Dex!</i>
- [spectators cheering]

267
00:10:43,776 --> 00:10:45,778
[applause]

268
00:10:46,279 --> 00:10:48,548
[♪ tense music playing]

269
00:10:53,186 --> 00:10:55,188
[spectators cheering intensifies]

270
00:11:02,362 --> 00:11:04,397
- [Dex cheers]
- [spectators cheering intensifies]

271
00:11:05,965 --> 00:11:07,901
[Lee] The blockbuster
boxing survival show.

272
00:11:07,967 --> 00:11:10,436
{\an8}Welcome to <i>I Am Boxer</i>.

273
00:11:11,104 --> 00:11:13,106
[spectators cheering]

274
00:11:15,208 --> 00:11:19,612
Hi, I'm Don Lee, a small local gym owner,

275
00:11:20,113 --> 00:11:23,016
and the Master of <i>I Am Boxer</i>.

276
00:11:23,082 --> 00:11:24,450
Nice to meet you.

277
00:11:24,517 --> 00:11:26,653
[spectators cheering]

278
00:11:26,719 --> 00:11:30,590
It all comes down to the final match.

279
00:11:30,657 --> 00:11:33,626
The match that will crown the champion.

280
00:11:33,693 --> 00:11:37,797
The finals will be
a 10-round boxing match,

281
00:11:37,864 --> 00:11:39,399
three minutes per round.

282
00:11:39,465 --> 00:11:40,733
[spectator] That's intense.

283
00:11:40,800 --> 00:11:42,068
[Lee] Ladies and gentlemen,

284
00:11:42,135 --> 00:11:44,671
only top-level boxers can handle

285
00:11:45,171 --> 00:11:48,641
ten three-minute rounds.

286
00:11:48,708 --> 00:11:50,610
This will be a massive bout.

287
00:11:51,110 --> 00:11:53,546
Are you all ready to enjoy this?

288
00:11:53,613 --> 00:11:55,782
- [Seungheon] Yeah!
- [Lee] Yeah!

289
00:11:55,848 --> 00:11:59,686
The show that will ignite
a boxing boom in Korea, <i>I Am Boxer</i>,

290
00:11:59,752 --> 00:12:01,421
starts now.

291
00:12:01,921 --> 00:12:03,923
[spectators cheering]

292
00:12:06,359 --> 00:12:11,931
Shall we introduce the stars
who joined us for today's finals?

293
00:12:12,498 --> 00:12:13,566
[Lee] Absolutely.

294
00:12:14,267 --> 00:12:16,369
- They're the legends of Korean boxing.
- [spectators cheering]

295
00:12:16,436 --> 00:12:19,505
{\an8}[Lee] Champion Park Chongpal
and Champion Yuh Myungwoo.

296
00:12:19,572 --> 00:12:21,207
{\an8}PARK CHONGPAL, YUH MYUNGWOO

297
00:12:22,108 --> 00:12:25,245
I think the audience is really
going to love our next guests.

298
00:12:25,311 --> 00:12:27,780
We have an amazing lineup
of celebrity chefs today.

299
00:12:27,847 --> 00:12:31,184
{\an8}Please welcome Chef Lee Yeonbok,
Chef Edward Lee, and Chef Jung Jisun!

300
00:12:31,251 --> 00:12:32,785
{\an8}- Hey, our beloved chefs!
- [cheering]

301
00:12:32,852 --> 00:12:36,089
{\an8}[Jongkook] We also have
in our audience, Singer YOUNGTAK!

302
00:12:36,155 --> 00:12:38,791
- And right beside him is Actress Oh Nara.
- [♪ tense music playing]

303
00:12:39,592 --> 00:12:40,727
{\an8}[Lee] Please say hello.

304
00:12:41,227 --> 00:12:45,231
{\an8}[Jongkook] I also see Actress Park Haseon,
and Yubin of Wonder Girls.

305
00:12:45,298 --> 00:12:46,966
She showed us her signature choreo.

306
00:12:47,033 --> 00:12:49,702
And joining us as well, members of my gym.

307
00:12:49,769 --> 00:12:52,305
Please welcome Actress Lee Joobeen.

308
00:12:52,372 --> 00:12:55,241
{\an8}LEE JOOBEEN
ACTRESS

309
00:12:55,308 --> 00:12:58,144
[Lee] Right next to her,
we have rapper Simon Dominic.

310
00:12:58,211 --> 00:12:59,979
{\an8}- [Jongkook] Simon Dominic's here?
- [Dex exclaims]

311
00:13:00,046 --> 00:13:03,249
{\an8}<i>♪ Simon, Simon Dominic ♪</i>

312
00:13:03,316 --> 00:13:06,552
[Jongkook] He's been training
really hard in boxing lately.

313
00:13:06,619 --> 00:13:08,921
So many celebrities are
into boxing these days.

314
00:13:08,988 --> 00:13:12,091
We also have Jung Chansung

315
00:13:12,158 --> 00:13:16,663
{\an8}and Max Holloway watching this match.

316
00:13:17,664 --> 00:13:20,933
{\an8}Next up, our number one celebrity fighter.

317
00:13:22,402 --> 00:13:24,437
Give it up for Burger Brother, Hyojun.

318
00:13:24,504 --> 00:13:27,273
{\an8}[Dex] The champ himself!
[exclaims, laughs]

319
00:13:27,340 --> 00:13:28,841
{\an8}PARK HYOJUN
ACTOR & NO. 1 CELEB FIGHTER?

320
00:13:28,908 --> 00:13:30,910
{\an8}[Jongkook] He certainly has
that Tyson-look.

321
00:13:31,411 --> 00:13:33,413
{\an8}[Seungheon] And right beside him,

322
00:13:33,479 --> 00:13:35,715
{\an8}joining us to support me, her husband,

323
00:13:35,782 --> 00:13:36,916
{\an8}Ms. Ye Junghwa.

324
00:13:36,983 --> 00:13:38,117
{\an8}[Jongkook] There you are!

325
00:13:38,184 --> 00:13:40,119
{\an8}[Lee] Let's hear it for her, everyone.

326
00:13:40,186 --> 00:13:42,221
[Jongkook] Look at that,
she's sending hearts our way.

327
00:13:42,722 --> 00:13:46,559
[Dex] Again, thank you
to everyone for joining us tonight.

328
00:13:47,593 --> 00:13:50,697
Before we get started on the semifinals,
Dex and I have prepared

329
00:13:50,763 --> 00:13:54,067
a very special match for you.

330
00:13:54,133 --> 00:13:57,437
Wait till you see who's coming out.

331
00:13:57,503 --> 00:13:59,939
You're in for a real surprise.

332
00:14:00,006 --> 00:14:03,776
Even I got excited when I heard
who'd be part of this special match.

333
00:14:03,843 --> 00:14:07,380
[Dex] Right, it is truly
a clash of Korean boxing legends.

334
00:14:07,447 --> 00:14:10,983
Let's bring out the fighters

335
00:14:11,050 --> 00:14:12,919
for the first special match.

336
00:14:13,820 --> 00:14:18,091
Entering from the blue corner,

337
00:14:18,157 --> 00:14:21,294
Thunder, Kwon Ohgon!

338
00:14:21,361 --> 00:14:23,463
{\an8}- [spectators cheering]
- [applause]

339
00:14:23,529 --> 00:14:25,531
[♪ tense music playing]

340
00:14:27,734 --> 00:14:31,938
{\an8}THUNDER KWON OHGON

341
00:14:32,004 --> 00:14:35,708
[Seungheon] This is the <i>I Am Boxer</i> finals,
kicking things off with a special match.

342
00:14:35,775 --> 00:14:37,744
{\an8}Here's our first fighter, Kwon Ohgon.

343
00:14:37,810 --> 00:14:42,115
[Gyuwon] He's widely regarded
as the fastest boxer in Korea today.

344
00:14:42,181 --> 00:14:44,584
{\an8}KWON OHGON'S WIFE

345
00:14:45,151 --> 00:14:46,586
[spectator 2] Let's go!

346
00:14:47,620 --> 00:14:49,088
[spectator 3] Man, he's cool!

347
00:14:53,126 --> 00:14:55,128
[spectators cheering continues]

348
00:14:56,596 --> 00:14:57,964
[spectator] You're the man!

349
00:15:04,003 --> 00:15:05,104
[team member 1] Let's do this.

350
00:15:05,171 --> 00:15:08,708
[team member 2] Let's not get hurt today.
Just have fun and stay safe.

351
00:15:08,775 --> 00:15:10,810
- One, two, three, let's go!
- [team members] Yeah!

352
00:15:16,382 --> 00:15:19,385
[Seungheon] Though he
narrowly missed the finals,

353
00:15:19,452 --> 00:15:21,754
he's a fighter who's inspired many others.

354
00:15:21,821 --> 00:15:24,624
I'm curious to see
what kind of fight he puts on tonight.

355
00:15:24,690 --> 00:15:26,192
That was Kwon Ohgon.

356
00:15:26,993 --> 00:15:28,294
All right.

357
00:15:29,762 --> 00:15:32,165
You stood up earlier,
and it put pressure on him.

358
00:15:33,466 --> 00:15:34,467
[chuckles]

359
00:15:34,534 --> 00:15:37,003
We never said we'd stand up
when introducing the fighter,

360
00:15:37,069 --> 00:15:39,439
- but since Dex went ahead and did it...
- [chuckles]

361
00:15:39,505 --> 00:15:42,208
...I guess I will too. [inhales deeply]

362
00:15:42,275 --> 00:15:47,847
Entering from the red corner,
Snyper, Kim Minuk!

363
00:15:47,914 --> 00:15:49,916
- [spectators cheering]
- [applause]

364
00:15:54,687 --> 00:15:56,756
HAIRY HUNK KIM MINUK

365
00:15:56,823 --> 00:15:58,825
[♪ tense music playing]

366
00:16:02,695 --> 00:16:06,532
{\an8}SNYPER KIM MINUK

367
00:16:07,200 --> 00:16:09,335
[Seungheon] Now entering
the arena is Kim Minuk.

368
00:16:09,402 --> 00:16:11,404
[Gyuwon] A former East Asian champion,

369
00:16:11,471 --> 00:16:15,074
known for his crisp, Mexican-style boxing.

370
00:16:15,575 --> 00:16:18,110
{\an8}KIM MINUK'S WIFE

371
00:16:24,150 --> 00:16:26,152
[spectators cheering continues]

372
00:16:30,356 --> 00:16:33,392
There's real weight to his presence, huh?

373
00:16:33,459 --> 00:16:35,495
- I got chills.
- Same.

374
00:16:36,762 --> 00:16:37,763
[Minuk supporter] Son!

375
00:16:39,365 --> 00:16:40,666
[spectator 2] Let's go!

376
00:16:42,502 --> 00:16:45,605
{\an8}KIM MINUK'S PARENTS

377
00:16:47,206 --> 00:16:49,208
[spectators cheering continues]

378
00:16:50,343 --> 00:16:52,044
[Seungheon] We'll be watching
for that big shot!

379
00:16:52,111 --> 00:16:53,646
Snyper, Kim Minuk!

380
00:16:54,514 --> 00:16:56,816
[spectators cheering intensifies]

381
00:17:08,661 --> 00:17:11,230
- [spectator 1] Let's go, Kim Minuk!
- [spectators cheering]

382
00:17:11,297 --> 00:17:13,499
{\an8}THUNDER KWON OHGON
X SNYPER KIM MINUK

383
00:17:15,801 --> 00:17:19,405
[Dex] Let's hear
from both fighters before the match.

384
00:17:19,472 --> 00:17:22,341
I've looked up to Kim Minuk
since high school.

385
00:17:22,408 --> 00:17:25,811
He's always been someone I admired.
A role model of mine.

386
00:17:25,878 --> 00:17:29,315
I'm grateful
to be part of a match like this,

387
00:17:29,382 --> 00:17:31,450
one you don't get just anywhere.

388
00:17:31,517 --> 00:17:33,386
A lot of time has passed, sir.

389
00:17:33,452 --> 00:17:36,322
Tonight, I'll aim to rise higher than you.

390
00:17:36,389 --> 00:17:37,423
- Thank you.
- [cheering]

391
00:17:37,490 --> 00:17:39,592
{\an8}I LURV YOU

392
00:17:43,095 --> 00:17:45,665
Tonight, I'll demonstrate exactly why

393
00:17:46,165 --> 00:17:49,201
an East Asian Champion
is a step above a Korean Champion.

394
00:17:49,268 --> 00:17:51,304
Please watch and observe.

395
00:17:51,370 --> 00:17:52,738
[spectators clamoring]

396
00:17:52,805 --> 00:17:55,474
{\an8}No! Don't do that!

397
00:17:56,008 --> 00:18:00,212
True to the name Snyper,
I'll show you what I'm made of.

398
00:18:00,279 --> 00:18:01,280
Thank you!

399
00:18:01,347 --> 00:18:03,583
{\an8}- [spectators cheering]
- [spectator] All right, Mr. Handsome!

400
00:18:03,649 --> 00:18:05,985
- All right. Great.
- [Jongkook chuckles]

401
00:18:06,719 --> 00:18:09,855
It's a great matchup, sure.

402
00:18:09,922 --> 00:18:12,291
But the cornermen are just as impressive.

403
00:18:12,358 --> 00:18:15,461
{\an8}Joining us ringside,
Actors Im Sungjae and Kim Minseok.

404
00:18:15,528 --> 00:18:19,198
{\an8}They're also big fans of boxing.

405
00:18:21,233 --> 00:18:23,536
All right, fighters,
prepare for the match.

406
00:18:24,337 --> 00:18:26,539
[Seungheon] Kwon Ohgon versus Kim Minuk.

407
00:18:26,606 --> 00:18:30,543
It's a matchup
boxing fans have long waited for.

408
00:18:30,610 --> 00:18:33,446
- [♪ tense music playing]
- [Gyuwon] Both fighters excel at timing,

409
00:18:33,512 --> 00:18:35,615
so expect a razor-thin, explosive battle.

410
00:18:36,115 --> 00:18:39,652
[Minuk] <i>First off, we're pretty close.</i>

411
00:18:39,719 --> 00:18:44,190
<i>It's not easy fighting someone
who's like a little brother to me.</i>

412
00:18:44,256 --> 00:18:46,125
But I hope he gives it everything.

413
00:18:46,192 --> 00:18:48,861
<i>Otherwise,
he won't be able to keep up with me.</i>

414
00:18:49,395 --> 00:18:53,265
Tonight, I'm going to crush him.

415
00:18:53,332 --> 00:18:57,703
<i>I hope we put on a great fight
for the audience, sir.</i>

416
00:18:57,770 --> 00:19:00,139
[Jongkook] The <i>I Am Boxer</i> special match!

417
00:19:00,206 --> 00:19:01,674
Let's begin the first matchup

418
00:19:02,742 --> 00:19:04,110
right now!

419
00:19:06,679 --> 00:19:08,914
- All right, box!
- [bell dings]

420
00:19:08,981 --> 00:19:10,416
{\an8}KIM MINUK X KWON OHGON

421
00:19:10,483 --> 00:19:13,119
{\an8}[Seungheon] The first round is underway.
Kwon Ohgon versus Kim Minuk!

422
00:19:13,819 --> 00:19:15,521
{\an8}[spectator] Let's go, Minuk!

423
00:19:15,588 --> 00:19:17,189
{\an8}[Seungheon] Kwon Ohgon starts
with the left.

424
00:19:19,425 --> 00:19:21,794
[Gyuwon] A battle for lead-hand control is
unfolding right now.

425
00:19:21,861 --> 00:19:24,730
This opening exchange is all about
who controls the rhythm.

426
00:19:24,797 --> 00:19:26,766
- It's about who takes control.
- [Seungheon] That's right.

427
00:19:27,633 --> 00:19:29,335
[spectators clamor]

428
00:19:30,169 --> 00:19:31,804
[Seungheon] Both fighters
exchange punches.

429
00:19:31,871 --> 00:19:33,305
[♪ tense music playing]

430
00:19:33,372 --> 00:19:35,908
[Minuk] <i>Ohgon was using
his lead hand well.</i>

431
00:19:36,876 --> 00:19:40,312
<i>So I thought, "Don't force it.
Just slowly close the distance."</i>

432
00:19:44,850 --> 00:19:46,285
Kim strikes and quickly slips.

433
00:19:46,352 --> 00:19:47,887
[spectators exclaim]

434
00:19:49,588 --> 00:19:51,190
[Seungheon] Kwon Ohgon goes to the body!

435
00:19:55,294 --> 00:19:57,263
Kwon eases back.

436
00:19:57,329 --> 00:19:58,698
Use the lead hand!

437
00:19:59,532 --> 00:20:01,434
[Minseok] You've gotta work the jab!

438
00:20:02,635 --> 00:20:04,270
[Jongkook] He's not holding back.

439
00:20:04,336 --> 00:20:06,772
Since there aren't many rounds,
Kwon Ohgon's just going for it.

440
00:20:06,839 --> 00:20:08,274
Yes, it's only three rounds.

441
00:20:09,141 --> 00:20:11,544
[spectator] All right! Nice!

442
00:20:12,578 --> 00:20:15,715
- None of Kwon Ohgon's punches landed.
- No.

443
00:20:15,781 --> 00:20:17,349
Everything was blocked.

444
00:20:17,416 --> 00:20:18,884
[spectator] Keep it up!

445
00:20:18,951 --> 00:20:21,721
[Ohgon] <i>I kept tapping him
to probe for openings,</i>

446
00:20:22,221 --> 00:20:25,524
- <i>but Minuk's defense was just too solid.</i>
- [♪ tense music playing]

447
00:20:25,591 --> 00:20:26,892
[spectator 1] Find your range.

448
00:20:26,959 --> 00:20:28,260
Yes, keep that guard up!

449
00:20:28,327 --> 00:20:29,829
[spectators exclaim]

450
00:20:31,230 --> 00:20:34,033
- [exclaim]
- An amazing uppercut landed there!

451
00:20:34,100 --> 00:20:35,534
{\an8}Oh, no...

452
00:20:37,636 --> 00:20:39,238
[spectator 2] All right! That's it!

453
00:20:40,005 --> 00:20:42,041
[Minuk] <i>Once I start trading, I know.</i>

454
00:20:42,108 --> 00:20:44,443
<i>You get a feel for how he punches.</i>

455
00:20:47,446 --> 00:20:48,981
[Lee] Kim's got a good read on his moves.

456
00:20:50,483 --> 00:20:51,851
[Minuk] <i>Yeah. This is doable.</i>

457
00:20:51,917 --> 00:20:53,919
[♪ tense music playing]

458
00:20:54,720 --> 00:20:56,288
[spectator 1] Get out!
Circle out of there!

459
00:20:57,556 --> 00:20:59,125
Throw hard, but one at a time!

460
00:20:59,725 --> 00:21:00,793
Left to the body!

461
00:21:00,860 --> 00:21:02,495
- [exclaims]
- All right!

462
00:21:02,561 --> 00:21:06,332
[Gyuwon] Kim Minuk has started
to get a read on Kwon Ohgon's rhythm.

463
00:21:06,398 --> 00:21:09,268
He's slowly backing Kwon
into the corner now.

464
00:21:09,769 --> 00:21:11,604
[spectators clamor]

465
00:21:15,708 --> 00:21:17,777
- Keep the pressure up!
- Pressure him!

466
00:21:18,477 --> 00:21:19,912
Ohgon, circle out of there!

467
00:21:20,679 --> 00:21:22,148
{\an8}Get out of there! That's it!

468
00:21:27,820 --> 00:21:29,155
[Lee, spectators exclaim]

469
00:21:30,322 --> 00:21:32,158
[Lee, spectators exclaim]

470
00:21:33,893 --> 00:21:34,894
{\an8}[spectator] All right!

471
00:21:35,494 --> 00:21:36,495
{\an8}[bell dings]

472
00:21:36,562 --> 00:21:39,698
{\an8}[Seungheon] And that brings us
to the end of the round.

473
00:21:40,699 --> 00:21:42,802
- [applause]
- Kwon pressed forward at times.

474
00:21:42,868 --> 00:21:46,405
But as for Kim Minuk,
he spent the round calmly,

475
00:21:46,472 --> 00:21:48,440
easing his way into the fight.

476
00:21:48,507 --> 00:21:51,310
Round 1 was about
getting a read on each other's rhythm.

477
00:21:51,377 --> 00:21:52,945
Plus, there was some tactical probing.

478
00:21:53,712 --> 00:21:55,581
- [team member] You good so far, right?
- Yep.

479
00:21:55,648 --> 00:21:58,317
[team member] Relax a bit.
There's too much tension on every shot.

480
00:21:59,518 --> 00:22:02,488
One of the body shots landed,
so now he'll start guarding the body.

481
00:22:02,555 --> 00:22:04,423
When you throw your right combos,

482
00:22:04,490 --> 00:22:05,825
you lift your chin sometimes.

483
00:22:05,891 --> 00:22:07,526
Watch out for the uppercut there.

484
00:22:08,093 --> 00:22:11,864
[Minuk] <i>I plan to close the distance
and press harder moving forward.</i>

485
00:22:12,364 --> 00:22:14,366
[Seungheon] Let's see
if either fighter makes adjustments

486
00:22:14,433 --> 00:22:17,236
- as they get ready for the second round.
- [♪ tense music playing]

487
00:22:17,303 --> 00:22:19,004
- Let's go!
- Come on, stay strong!

488
00:22:20,306 --> 00:22:22,808
- [spectator 2] Let's go, Ohgon!
- Let's go!

489
00:22:23,475 --> 00:22:25,110
{\an8}KIM MINUK X KWON OHGON

490
00:22:25,177 --> 00:22:26,745
{\an8}[Seungheon] Here we go, the second round.

491
00:22:28,280 --> 00:22:30,282
{\an8}- [spectators cheering]
- [applause]

492
00:22:31,684 --> 00:22:33,719
{\an8}- [spectators clamoring]
- [exclaims]

493
00:22:33,786 --> 00:22:34,820
Kim's pressing hard.

494
00:22:34,887 --> 00:22:36,455
And he lands!

495
00:22:36,522 --> 00:22:37,523
Yes! All right!

496
00:22:38,757 --> 00:22:40,559
[spectator] Cover up, Ohgon! Cover up!

497
00:22:40,626 --> 00:22:42,528
- Don't just stand there!
- [♪ tense music playing]

498
00:22:45,097 --> 00:22:46,265
- [exclaims]
- Nice left shot!

499
00:22:47,266 --> 00:22:49,235
Neither of them likes to back up.

500
00:22:49,301 --> 00:22:50,402
They stand their ground.

501
00:22:51,470 --> 00:22:52,705
Just watch out for those!

502
00:22:52,771 --> 00:22:54,306
[spectator 2] Go! Throw the left!

503
00:22:54,373 --> 00:22:56,942
[Gyuwon] We're seeing
a test of durability here.

504
00:22:57,009 --> 00:22:58,978
Neither fighter is retreating at all!

505
00:22:59,044 --> 00:23:00,379
- That's it!
- There you go!

506
00:23:00,980 --> 00:23:02,281
Once again, excellent left jab.

507
00:23:02,348 --> 00:23:03,682
[spectator] Okay, just go for it!

508
00:23:03,749 --> 00:23:04,950
[Minseok] All right!

509
00:23:06,452 --> 00:23:07,786
[Jongkook] Man, he got caught there.

510
00:23:10,956 --> 00:23:12,825
[Seungheon] That was
a clean land from Kim Minuk!

511
00:23:14,093 --> 00:23:16,295
Kim is piling up the clean shots.

512
00:23:16,362 --> 00:23:17,663
[in English] All right, I rate that.

513
00:23:17,730 --> 00:23:19,365
- Oh!
- Nice speed.

514
00:23:19,431 --> 00:23:20,799
[in Korean] Push harder! Keep going!

515
00:23:21,567 --> 00:23:22,968
[Seungheon] Fire with him on the exit!

516
00:23:25,404 --> 00:23:27,039
Kim goes in for another uppercut.

517
00:23:28,474 --> 00:23:30,242
He went for a big one there.

518
00:23:32,912 --> 00:23:35,281
Kwon lets it glance off
and slips away cleanly.

519
00:23:35,347 --> 00:23:37,583
See that slip while turning his head?

520
00:23:38,918 --> 00:23:40,786
[Ohgon] <i>My gas tank was still full,</i>

521
00:23:40,853 --> 00:23:42,721
<i>so I decided to start applying pressure.</i>

522
00:23:43,355 --> 00:23:45,090
- [spectator] He's open!
- [Seungheon exclaims]

523
00:23:45,157 --> 00:23:46,325
Nice uppercut!

524
00:23:46,392 --> 00:23:47,393
Another uppercut!

525
00:23:47,459 --> 00:23:48,928
[exclaims]

526
00:23:48,994 --> 00:23:51,096
There. That uppercut landed clean.

527
00:23:52,131 --> 00:23:53,132
[Seungheon] Another uppercut!

528
00:23:53,198 --> 00:23:55,134
- [♪ tense music playing]
- That sends him stumbling!

529
00:23:57,303 --> 00:23:59,004
- Body and then hook! Nice!
- [spectators gasp]

530
00:24:01,106 --> 00:24:02,708
[Seungheon] He's firing
multiple uppercuts!

531
00:24:02,775 --> 00:24:04,076
Here comes sharp combo!

532
00:24:04,143 --> 00:24:05,577
Left, then right uppercut!

533
00:24:06,078 --> 00:24:09,415
- Kwon's looking to dictate the pace again.
- [Seungheon] That's right.

534
00:24:10,749 --> 00:24:12,084
- [exclaims]
- [clamor]

535
00:24:13,052 --> 00:24:14,420
- [exclaims]
- [clamor]

536
00:24:14,486 --> 00:24:15,688
That landed, didn't it?

537
00:24:15,754 --> 00:24:17,356
Hey, the momentum's shifting.

538
00:24:18,724 --> 00:24:21,293
[Seungheon] Kwon throws a counter
to the side. He's pressing forward again.

539
00:24:22,061 --> 00:24:23,228
[spectator] Go for it!

540
00:24:23,729 --> 00:24:25,597
[spectators clamor]

541
00:24:26,799 --> 00:24:27,967
- [exclaims]
- [clamors]

542
00:24:28,033 --> 00:24:29,168
[Lee] That caught him.

543
00:24:30,402 --> 00:24:35,107
[Minuk] <i>Ohgon was stronger
than I expected.</i>

544
00:24:35,174 --> 00:24:36,842
<i>Much tougher than I thought.</i>

545
00:24:39,712 --> 00:24:41,347
- [Seungheon] Go for it now!
- [Dex exclaims]

546
00:24:41,413 --> 00:24:43,983
- [exclaims]
- [spectators cheering]

547
00:24:44,049 --> 00:24:45,617
[♪ tense music playing]

548
00:24:45,684 --> 00:24:46,819
- [exclaims]
- [clamors]

549
00:24:47,386 --> 00:24:49,188
[Gyuwon] Neither fighter has backed
up until now.

550
00:24:49,254 --> 00:24:51,090
That was tonight's first slip and rip!

551
00:24:52,257 --> 00:24:55,160
[Seungheon] They're trading!
And there's that left jab from Kim!

552
00:24:55,227 --> 00:24:57,229
[spectators clamoring]

553
00:25:03,068 --> 00:25:04,837
- They traded.
- Yeah.

554
00:25:06,171 --> 00:25:08,507
[Gyuwon] This could swing
either way right now!

555
00:25:08,574 --> 00:25:10,275
[Seungheon] Wait,
are we seeing a clinch here?

556
00:25:10,342 --> 00:25:12,144
Is that the first one we've seen tonight?

557
00:25:12,211 --> 00:25:14,013
- [spectators cheering]
- [applause]

558
00:25:14,079 --> 00:25:15,147
They're back at it.

559
00:25:16,582 --> 00:25:18,183
[spectator] That's it!
Extend the lead hand!

560
00:25:18,250 --> 00:25:19,318
Extend that arm!

561
00:25:19,385 --> 00:25:20,753
[Sungjae exclaims]

562
00:25:21,253 --> 00:25:23,455
- [exclaims]
- [Seungheon] A sharp straight!

563
00:25:23,522 --> 00:25:25,357
[spectator] Stick it in, man!

564
00:25:25,424 --> 00:25:26,425
[Seungheon] Once again!

565
00:25:26,925 --> 00:25:28,293
That's it! Stick that right in!

566
00:25:29,561 --> 00:25:30,562
All right!

567
00:25:30,629 --> 00:25:31,864
Oh, that was nice.

568
00:25:31,930 --> 00:25:32,998
{\an8}[spectator] Keep it long!

569
00:25:35,134 --> 00:25:36,135
{\an8}[referee] Break!

570
00:25:36,201 --> 00:25:37,603
{\an8}- [bell dings]
- [referee] Break!

571
00:25:37,669 --> 00:25:39,772
- [cheering]
- And that's the end of the second round.

572
00:25:40,339 --> 00:25:42,408
[Gyuwon] This is absolutely gripping!

573
00:25:42,474 --> 00:25:46,712
[Seungheon] Both fighters are delivering,
living up to the "special match" label.

574
00:25:46,779 --> 00:25:49,081
Man, this is another level.
[exhales deeply]

575
00:25:49,148 --> 00:25:51,150
They're both tough opponents.

576
00:25:52,451 --> 00:25:54,286
[Sungjae] It's the third round, Ohgon.

577
00:25:54,353 --> 00:25:55,354
What's your game?

578
00:25:55,421 --> 00:25:56,889
Wanna go to war?

579
00:25:56,955 --> 00:25:58,257
- I can do that.
- [Sungjae] Okay.

580
00:25:58,323 --> 00:25:59,892
You can do this, man. You got this.

581
00:26:01,293 --> 00:26:04,063
- Man, I just stood there and took it.
- [Minseok] Right, you can't do that.

582
00:26:04,129 --> 00:26:06,131
- [Minuk] <i>It wasn't easy at all.</i>
- [tense music playing]

583
00:26:07,833 --> 00:26:09,868
[Minuk] <i>While staying cautious
of his lead hand,</i>

584
00:26:09,935 --> 00:26:13,038
<i>I got pulled into his rhythm a bit.</i>

585
00:26:14,039 --> 00:26:15,841
- Hey, this is the last one.
- Got it.

586
00:26:16,842 --> 00:26:21,146
<i>In the final round,
I'm giving it everything I've got.</i>

587
00:26:22,448 --> 00:26:25,384
[Ohgon] <i>It's the final round,
so I'm going to press even harder.</i>

588
00:26:25,451 --> 00:26:29,621
<i>I'll show that I can surpass Kim Minuk,
no matter what.</i>

589
00:26:29,688 --> 00:26:31,723
- It all comes down to this last round.
- [cheers]

590
00:26:31,790 --> 00:26:32,791
- [cheering]
- [applause]

591
00:26:32,858 --> 00:26:34,226
{\an8}Let's go!

592
00:26:34,293 --> 00:26:35,694
Last round, Ohgon!

593
00:26:36,228 --> 00:26:38,697
- Minuk, let's go!
- You got this!

594
00:26:39,898 --> 00:26:41,767
- Final round. Make it count.
- Yes, let's go.

595
00:26:41,834 --> 00:26:43,335
Show me a professional fight.

596
00:26:43,402 --> 00:26:44,770
{\an8}- [bell dings]
- All right.

597
00:26:44,837 --> 00:26:47,539
{\an8}[Seungheon] And here we go,
the third and final round.

598
00:26:47,606 --> 00:26:49,408
{\an8}KIM MINUK X KWON OHGON

599
00:26:49,475 --> 00:26:52,711
{\an8}[Gyuwon] It's not about technique anymore.
It's about will and focus!

600
00:26:52,778 --> 00:26:54,313
- Wonderful start!
- [clamoring]

601
00:26:54,379 --> 00:26:55,881
That connected super clean.

602
00:26:55,948 --> 00:26:58,050
- [spectator] Lead hand!
- [♪ tense music playing]

603
00:26:58,117 --> 00:27:00,085
- [spectator 1] All right!
- [spectator 2] Great!

604
00:27:02,087 --> 00:27:03,088
- [exclaims]
- [exclaims]

605
00:27:03,155 --> 00:27:05,257
Kim lets his hands go! Kwon fires back!

606
00:27:06,225 --> 00:27:08,060
He's pressing forward!

607
00:27:10,395 --> 00:27:12,631
[Gyuwon] Kwon Ohgon's on a vicious flurry!

608
00:27:12,698 --> 00:27:14,066
[spectators clamoring continues]

609
00:27:14,133 --> 00:27:15,134
[Lee exclaims]

610
00:27:15,200 --> 00:27:16,869
Ohgon got caught just now!

611
00:27:18,003 --> 00:27:19,505
[Seungheon exclaims]

612
00:27:23,175 --> 00:27:25,210
[Gyuwon] Kim Minuk isn't letting
that opening slip!

613
00:27:25,277 --> 00:27:27,012
[Seungheon] He was waiting to counter!

614
00:27:28,514 --> 00:27:30,249
[spectator] Ohgon,
keep the lead hand long!

615
00:27:30,315 --> 00:27:32,050
[Jongkook] Kim Minuk is watching him.

616
00:27:33,819 --> 00:27:37,322
[Seungheon] This is Kim Minuk's
wheelhouse, working off the ropes.

617
00:27:37,389 --> 00:27:39,057
Let's see if it works this time.

618
00:27:39,124 --> 00:27:40,959
[Lee] He's looking
to fire back with a counter.

619
00:27:41,026 --> 00:27:42,261
[spectator] Leave him!

620
00:27:42,327 --> 00:27:43,729
[Seungheon] A heavy exchange in close!

621
00:27:44,329 --> 00:27:45,564
[spectator] Body, then upstairs!

622
00:27:45,631 --> 00:27:47,399
- There you go!
- [exclaims]

623
00:27:47,466 --> 00:27:49,201
[Seungheon] Kwon going to the body!

624
00:27:49,268 --> 00:27:50,702
And Kim to the head!

625
00:27:50,769 --> 00:27:52,538
- [spectator] Yes! That's it!
- [♪ tense music playing]

626
00:27:52,604 --> 00:27:54,039
[spectator 1] All right!

627
00:27:55,574 --> 00:27:58,010
[Gyuwon] Kim Minuk's focus is incredible.

628
00:28:01,113 --> 00:28:02,648
Break! Break!

629
00:28:02,714 --> 00:28:03,916
[spectator] All right!

630
00:28:08,220 --> 00:28:10,222
Minuk, you got this!

631
00:28:10,289 --> 00:28:11,590
- Kim Minuk!
- Kim Minuk!

632
00:28:11,657 --> 00:28:12,925
Let's go!

633
00:28:13,592 --> 00:28:15,561
[spectators cheering]

634
00:28:18,197 --> 00:28:22,267
[Gyuwon] Will it be Kwon Ohgon's
aggression, or Kim Minuk's cold precision?

635
00:28:24,269 --> 00:28:27,139
[Seungheon] Both fighters have been
waiting for this stage!

636
00:28:27,206 --> 00:28:29,474
[spectators clamoring continues]

637
00:28:31,243 --> 00:28:32,244
[Lee] He's not backing off.

638
00:28:32,311 --> 00:28:33,545
He's countering right back.

639
00:28:34,346 --> 00:28:35,914
Okay, now come out and fight!

640
00:28:36,448 --> 00:28:37,549
Rip the uppercut!

641
00:28:39,218 --> 00:28:40,786
[Seungheon] He's working the uppercut.

642
00:28:40,852 --> 00:28:43,555
[Gyuwon] Now that's a beautiful uppercut!

643
00:28:44,223 --> 00:28:46,858
Let's go, Minuk! You got this!

644
00:28:46,925 --> 00:28:49,761
[Minseok] Fight like this is your last!
Dig deep right now!

645
00:28:49,828 --> 00:28:50,963
Stick the lead hand in!

646
00:28:51,029 --> 00:28:53,699
- [spectator 2] You've gotta dig deeper!
- [♪ tense music playing]

647
00:28:56,535 --> 00:28:58,370
[spectator 3] Ohgon, you're almost there!

648
00:28:58,437 --> 00:29:00,906
- [Minseok] All right! He's caught!
- [exclaims]

649
00:29:01,607 --> 00:29:03,008
[spectators exclaim]

650
00:29:03,075 --> 00:29:05,577
[Gyuwon] He sets the angle
and counters with a shovel hook!

651
00:29:06,411 --> 00:29:08,614
[Seungheon] Both fighters are throwing
with full power.

652
00:29:10,282 --> 00:29:12,184
{\an8}Come on, please...

653
00:29:12,251 --> 00:29:13,785
Go, go!

654
00:29:14,786 --> 00:29:16,188
[Gyuwon] It's time to decide this fight.

655
00:29:16,255 --> 00:29:17,289
[spectator] Doing great!

656
00:29:17,356 --> 00:29:19,157
[spectator 1] Ohgon! Last push!

657
00:29:22,261 --> 00:29:25,097
[Gyuwon] From here on out,
this isn't about stamina!

658
00:29:25,163 --> 00:29:26,732
It's about concentration!

659
00:29:27,599 --> 00:29:29,368
- You got this!
- Let's go!

660
00:29:29,434 --> 00:29:30,936
[spectators cheering]

661
00:29:31,003 --> 00:29:32,771
[Seungheon] Kim's loading
up on the right again!

662
00:29:33,872 --> 00:29:35,707
[Sungjae] All right!
Keep going till the end!

663
00:29:36,675 --> 00:29:38,944
- Fight like it's your last, man!
- This is it!

664
00:29:39,011 --> 00:29:40,846
[Minseok] Fight like it's your last, man!

665
00:29:42,381 --> 00:29:43,382
[cheering, clamoring stops]

666
00:29:46,285 --> 00:29:48,287
[♪ calming music playing]

667
00:30:18,050 --> 00:30:20,185
{\an8}- [bell dings]
- [spectators cheering]

668
00:30:20,752 --> 00:30:24,356
[Seungheon] And that's
the end of the fight!

669
00:30:24,856 --> 00:30:26,858
- [bell dings]
- [spectators cheering]

670
00:30:26,925 --> 00:30:28,927
[applause]

671
00:30:28,994 --> 00:30:31,063
[♪ triumphant music playing]

672
00:30:31,129 --> 00:30:32,130
[cheers]

673
00:30:32,998 --> 00:30:35,000
[spectators cheering continues]

674
00:30:37,269 --> 00:30:40,238
[Gyuwon] This wasn't just about technique.

675
00:30:40,305 --> 00:30:42,741
This was fought with heart and passion.

676
00:30:42,808 --> 00:30:44,109
What a fight.

677
00:30:45,377 --> 00:30:47,946
- That was incredible. Truly incredible.
- [spectator exclaims]

678
00:30:48,013 --> 00:30:50,315
- They left it all out there.
- Totally.

679
00:30:50,882 --> 00:30:52,784
[Lee] We will now announce the result.

680
00:30:53,485 --> 00:30:58,623
The decision was rendered by
three of Korea's top judges.

681
00:30:59,691 --> 00:31:01,193
By judges' decision...

682
00:31:01,259 --> 00:31:03,362
[♪ tense music playing]

683
00:31:03,962 --> 00:31:05,897
The winner of this match is...

684
00:31:07,065 --> 00:31:08,900
[Minuk] <i>I had no doubt I'd win.</i>

685
00:31:09,568 --> 00:31:12,571
[Ohgon] <i>"In this fight at least,
I came out on top."</i>

686
00:31:12,637 --> 00:31:13,805
<i>That's what I thought.</i>

687
00:31:14,806 --> 00:31:16,508
By a split decision, two to one.

688
00:31:19,678 --> 00:31:22,447
{\an8}I LURV YOU

689
00:31:23,882 --> 00:31:25,684
{\an8}Kim Minuk from the red corner.

690
00:31:25,751 --> 00:31:29,988
{\an8}RED CORNER KIM MINUK WINS

691
00:31:30,055 --> 00:31:32,057
- [spectators cheering]
- [applause]

692
00:31:32,124 --> 00:31:34,292
[♪ triumphant music playing]

693
00:31:35,961 --> 00:31:38,897
All right! He won!

694
00:31:41,466 --> 00:31:43,168
You did great!

695
00:31:43,769 --> 00:31:46,772
- [spectator 1] Kim Minuk! Kim Minuk!
- [spectators] Kim Minuk! Kim Minuk!

696
00:31:46,838 --> 00:31:49,341
[Minuk] <i>It's been
a long time since I retired,</i>

697
00:31:49,408 --> 00:31:53,745
<i>so I'm deeply grateful to everyone
who came out to support me.</i>

698
00:31:55,547 --> 00:31:57,449
Fighting here at Jangchung Arena

699
00:31:57,516 --> 00:31:59,384
was a deeply moving experience,

700
00:31:59,451 --> 00:32:01,920
and I'm so happy I won.

701
00:32:02,721 --> 00:32:06,024
I first want to thank Kim Minuk

702
00:32:06,091 --> 00:32:09,060
for taking on this fight.
It couldn't have been easy.

703
00:32:09,594 --> 00:32:13,265
I hope this intense survival show
becomes a turning point

704
00:32:13,331 --> 00:32:15,801
that pushes me forward in my life.
Thank you.

705
00:32:15,867 --> 00:32:17,636
- [spectators cheering]
- [applause]

706
00:32:17,702 --> 00:32:19,004
{\an8}[spectator] You did awesome!

707
00:32:19,070 --> 00:32:20,839
[♪ tense music playing]

708
00:32:20,906 --> 00:32:24,676
The passion has been off the charts
from the first special match.

709
00:32:25,377 --> 00:32:27,913
Did you have fun, everyone?

710
00:32:27,979 --> 00:32:29,614
[audience] Yes!

711
00:32:29,681 --> 00:32:32,984
Well, we still have one more match to go.

712
00:32:33,051 --> 00:32:35,754
Coming up next,
a matchup between two powerhouses,

713
00:32:36,288 --> 00:32:39,658
