722
00:32:59,644 --> 00:33:02,013
Let's bring in the fighters
for the second match.

723
00:33:02,514 --> 00:33:05,016
The man who's lovely from head to toe.

724
00:33:05,517 --> 00:33:10,889
Entering from the blue corner,
Tyson, Hong Sungmin!

725
00:33:10,956 --> 00:33:12,357
[audience cheers, applauds]

726
00:33:13,291 --> 00:33:15,060
- [person 1] Look at that.
- [person 2] He's adorable.

727
00:33:15,126 --> 00:33:16,328
[person 3] It's that cheerful guy.

728
00:33:16,394 --> 00:33:18,363
[person 4]
Makes you wanna copy that pose, right?

729
00:33:19,064 --> 00:33:22,667
{\an8}TYSON HONG SUNGMIN

730
00:33:22,734 --> 00:33:23,735
[♪ majestic music playing]

731
00:33:23,802 --> 00:33:28,173
[Seungheon] First up,
Hong Sungmin is now entering the arena.

732
00:33:28,240 --> 00:33:29,708
[audience cheering]

733
00:33:34,980 --> 00:33:38,583
[Seungheon] When <i>I Am Boxer</i> kicked off,
Kim Donghoe and Kim Minuk,

734
00:33:38,650 --> 00:33:41,419
these two fighters
were considered title contenders.

735
00:33:41,486 --> 00:33:44,556
And Hong Sungmin is the man
who eliminated them both.

736
00:33:49,661 --> 00:33:50,896
{\an8}[audience cheering]

737
00:33:51,863 --> 00:33:52,931
[laughs]

738
00:33:55,734 --> 00:33:56,801
[person 1] He's dancing!

739
00:33:56,868 --> 00:33:58,537
<i>♪ Lovely from head to toe ♪</i>

740
00:34:03,775 --> 00:34:04,976
[person 2] The champion belt.

741
00:34:06,978 --> 00:34:07,979
No!

742
00:34:11,383 --> 00:34:13,151
[person 3] He's so funny.

743
00:34:20,392 --> 00:34:23,628
[Dex] Lookin' relaxed!
Lookin' super relaxed, man!

744
00:34:25,063 --> 00:34:26,231
I love it!

745
00:34:27,766 --> 00:34:31,803
[Jongkook]
The fighter facing Hong Sungmin is...

746
00:34:31,870 --> 00:34:33,371
Entering from the red corner!

747
00:34:34,205 --> 00:34:38,443
- Saja<i>,</i> Myung Hyunman!
- Let's go!

748
00:34:38,510 --> 00:34:40,145
SAJA MYUNG HYUNMAN'S
SOY-MARINATED CRAB PUNCH

749
00:34:40,211 --> 00:34:44,416
MYUNG HYUNMAN

750
00:34:44,482 --> 00:34:45,951
[bell tolls]

751
00:34:46,818 --> 00:34:48,253
[audience gasps]

752
00:34:48,320 --> 00:34:50,088
[person 1]
Hey, it's the Undertaker's theme song.

753
00:34:51,723 --> 00:34:52,891
[bell tolls]

754
00:34:52,958 --> 00:34:55,026
[audience gasps, cheers]

755
00:34:55,527 --> 00:34:56,661
[person 2] This is scary as hell.

756
00:34:56,728 --> 00:34:58,296
[person 3] They picked his theme well.

757
00:34:58,363 --> 00:35:00,065
[♪ somber music playing]

758
00:35:00,131 --> 00:35:04,102
{\an8}SAJA MYUNG HYUNMAN

759
00:35:06,304 --> 00:35:09,507
[Seungheon] And now, let's welcome
Myung Hyunman to the arena!

760
00:35:10,075 --> 00:35:11,843
[audience cheering, applauding]

761
00:35:16,781 --> 00:35:18,316
[Dex] Feels like the final boss is here.

762
00:35:21,987 --> 00:35:24,222
{\an8}[Gyuwon] Myung Hyunman
is a fighter long regarded

763
00:35:24,289 --> 00:35:26,491
as a symbol of Korean combat sports.

764
00:35:29,427 --> 00:35:31,997
[Dex] Look, a crab!
He's got a crab on his robe!

765
00:35:32,530 --> 00:35:33,798
See that crab on his back?

766
00:35:39,838 --> 00:35:41,973
[Hyeongbin] Myung Hyunman, let's go!

767
00:35:43,241 --> 00:35:45,543
[person 1] Man, that's cool.
He's coming in totally relaxed.

768
00:35:54,653 --> 00:35:56,221
[person 2] He's super scary.

769
00:36:01,860 --> 00:36:03,328
[audience cheering, applauding]

770
00:36:04,829 --> 00:36:06,197
[Hyeongbin] Let's do this!

771
00:36:06,698 --> 00:36:07,899
[cheers]

772
00:36:08,667 --> 00:36:10,602
[Jongkook] As you can see,

773
00:36:10,669 --> 00:36:12,771
there's a noticeable size difference here.

774
00:36:12,837 --> 00:36:16,174
There's almost a 30-kilo difference
between the two.

775
00:36:16,241 --> 00:36:17,575
[audience gasps]

776
00:36:17,642 --> 00:36:19,077
[person 1] Is this even right?

777
00:36:19,144 --> 00:36:20,812
[person 2] This makes no sense.

778
00:36:20,879 --> 00:36:22,881
[person 3] There's a 22-centimeter
difference in reach.

779
00:36:23,381 --> 00:36:25,784
- [person 4] King crab versus snow crab.
- [person 5 chuckles]

780
00:36:27,352 --> 00:36:29,054
[audience laughing]

781
00:36:29,120 --> 00:36:30,321
[applauding]

782
00:36:31,456 --> 00:36:34,292
[Jongkook] Nice. Good one! Yeah.

783
00:36:36,294 --> 00:36:40,365
There's about a 30-kilo difference
between Myung Hyunman and me.

784
00:36:40,432 --> 00:36:44,169
But I'll show you
that boxing isn't about weight.

785
00:36:44,235 --> 00:36:48,473
Given his restaurant,
I'm sure he marinates his crabs well,

786
00:36:48,540 --> 00:36:51,476
but tonight, he's the one getting cooked.

787
00:36:51,976 --> 00:36:53,244
[audience cheering, applauding]

788
00:36:56,981 --> 00:36:58,416
[person 1] He doesn't look too pleased.

789
00:36:59,818 --> 00:37:04,122
Uh... I guess Hong Sungmin
is still too young to know.

790
00:37:04,189 --> 00:37:05,223
Here's the thing.

791
00:37:07,659 --> 00:37:09,194
[audience laughing]

792
00:37:09,260 --> 00:37:11,529
- [person 2] Wait, what?
- [person 3 laughing] Crab dance?

793
00:37:12,097 --> 00:37:13,665
- What was that?
- What's that?

794
00:37:14,365 --> 00:37:15,366
I...

795
00:37:15,934 --> 00:37:19,437
I'll show him
how scary this crab punch really is.

796
00:37:19,504 --> 00:37:21,439
[audience laughing, applauding]

797
00:37:21,506 --> 00:37:23,007
All right, sounds good.

798
00:37:23,074 --> 00:37:25,844
Looks like we'll see
his crab punch tonight! Yeah.

799
00:37:25,910 --> 00:37:26,945
[Lee] Wow.

800
00:37:29,047 --> 00:37:32,450
[Seungheon] Physically speaking,
Myung Hyunman has a huge advantage.

801
00:37:32,517 --> 00:37:36,721
The question is
how Hong Sungmin plans to overcome that.

802
00:37:37,489 --> 00:37:40,258
[Sungmin]
<i>Since I'm still an active fighter,</i>

803
00:37:40,325 --> 00:37:42,227
<i>I'll fight to defend my pride.</i>

804
00:37:42,727 --> 00:37:44,496
{\an8}PARK CHONGPAL
FORMER BOXING WORLD CHAMPION

805
00:37:44,562 --> 00:37:46,931
{\an8}- First, stay calm. Yeah?
- Yes. Got it.

806
00:37:46,998 --> 00:37:48,633
Second, stay calm.

807
00:37:48,700 --> 00:37:50,268
- Don't rush it.
- Yes, sir.

808
00:37:50,335 --> 00:37:51,436
[person] Let's go!

809
00:37:51,503 --> 00:37:53,471
Go, Hyunman!

810
00:37:53,538 --> 00:37:57,175
[Hyunman] <i>The crowd was cheering for me
pretty loudly.</i>

811
00:37:57,242 --> 00:37:59,010
<i>I want people to know I've still got it.</i>

812
00:37:59,077 --> 00:38:00,578
<i>That I'm still very much here.</i>

813
00:38:01,146 --> 00:38:03,081
[Jongkook] The <i>I Am Boxer</i> special match!

814
00:38:03,148 --> 00:38:06,084
Let's begin the second matchup right now!

815
00:38:07,352 --> 00:38:09,220
[audience cheering, applauding]

816
00:38:09,287 --> 00:38:10,889
[person 1] Gosh, I'm excited for this one.

817
00:38:11,456 --> 00:38:12,924
[person 2] Let's go, Hong Sungmin!

818
00:38:12,991 --> 00:38:13,992
Box!

819
00:38:14,058 --> 00:38:15,960
{\an8}- [referee] Box!
- [person 3] Let's go!

820
00:38:16,027 --> 00:38:17,862
{\an8}[Seungheon]
All right, the match has now begun.

821
00:38:17,929 --> 00:38:23,501
{\an8}MYUNG HYUNMAN X HONG SUNGMIN

822
00:38:25,570 --> 00:38:27,038
[audience gasps]

823
00:38:28,039 --> 00:38:29,040
[audience gasps]

824
00:38:31,376 --> 00:38:32,977
[Seungheon]
There's a clear reach advantage.

825
00:38:34,078 --> 00:38:36,147
- [Jongkook] Wow.
- [audience gasping]

826
00:38:38,583 --> 00:38:39,784
- [Jongkook] Wow.
- [audience gasps]

827
00:38:39,851 --> 00:38:41,019
[Lee] He caught him on the guard.

828
00:38:42,086 --> 00:38:44,322
- [Jongkook] Hey.
- [Lee] And it still had him wobbling.

829
00:38:45,290 --> 00:38:48,293
Hong Sungmin probably hasn't felt
a punch like that before.

830
00:38:48,359 --> 00:38:51,429
Fighters that size
don't come around very often.

831
00:38:51,496 --> 00:38:52,897
[♪ intense music playing]

832
00:38:52,964 --> 00:38:54,232
[audience gasping]

833
00:38:55,867 --> 00:38:57,702
[Seungheon] Myung Hyunman pushes in.

834
00:38:59,838 --> 00:39:02,307
[Gyuwon] Myung Hyunman's punches
are extremely dangerous.

835
00:39:03,107 --> 00:39:04,909
- [person 1] He's freakin' scary.
- [person 2 chuckles]

836
00:39:08,613 --> 00:39:10,949
[Seungheon] Myung keeps the pressure on
with the lead hand.

837
00:39:11,983 --> 00:39:13,351
And he strikes as he turns!

838
00:39:13,418 --> 00:39:14,719
Oh!

839
00:39:14,786 --> 00:39:16,287
- Hey!
- [audience gasps]

840
00:39:16,354 --> 00:39:19,090
- [Seungheon] And he strikes as he turns!
- [audience gasps]

841
00:39:19,891 --> 00:39:21,526
[person 1] That's gotta hurt so bad.

842
00:39:21,593 --> 00:39:23,461
[person 2] You got this, Sungmin!

843
00:39:23,528 --> 00:39:28,032
[Gyuwon] Hong Sungmin
hasn't found a clear angle of attack yet.

844
00:39:29,434 --> 00:39:31,536
He needs to get inside.

845
00:39:32,637 --> 00:39:33,972
[person 1] Let's go, Hyunman!

846
00:39:34,038 --> 00:39:35,106
[person 2] Let's go!

847
00:39:36,441 --> 00:39:37,775
[Seungheon] Hong Sungmin steps inside.

848
00:39:37,842 --> 00:39:39,110
[person 3] Stay calm!

849
00:39:41,145 --> 00:39:42,146
[referee] That's not good.

850
00:39:43,147 --> 00:39:44,782
- [person 4] Wow.
- [audience gasps]

851
00:39:45,516 --> 00:39:47,518
Stop! Stop!

852
00:39:48,019 --> 00:39:50,054
- [referee] No holding.
- [person 1] You got this!

853
00:39:50,121 --> 00:39:51,422
[person 2] Stay calm, Sungmin!

854
00:39:52,490 --> 00:39:54,292
- [referee] Box!
- [person 3] You got this!

855
00:39:54,359 --> 00:39:55,760
[♪ intense music playing]

856
00:39:58,162 --> 00:40:00,832
[Seungheon] Hong Sungmin continues
to press forward on the inside.

857
00:40:03,701 --> 00:40:06,638
Stop! Stop! Stop!

858
00:40:08,606 --> 00:40:12,110
It looks like he's clinching on purpose.

859
00:40:12,176 --> 00:40:14,145
Yeah, that's what it seems like.

860
00:40:14,212 --> 00:40:15,346
[referee] Two or three together!

861
00:40:15,413 --> 00:40:17,582
[Seungheon] Hong keeps his guard high
and stays on Myung.

862
00:40:17,649 --> 00:40:18,850
And he closes in.

863
00:40:18,917 --> 00:40:19,951
[audience gasps] All right!

864
00:40:20,018 --> 00:40:21,019
Ah...

865
00:40:22,654 --> 00:40:23,821
- [referee] Stop!
- [audience gasps]

866
00:40:23,888 --> 00:40:27,392
[Gyuwon] Myung Hyunman is clinching
whenever his opponent comes in.

867
00:40:30,228 --> 00:40:31,696
[Sungmin] <i>It was pretty frustrating.</i>

868
00:40:32,297 --> 00:40:34,399
{\an8}[person 1] Come on, Hyunman!

869
00:40:41,205 --> 00:40:43,107
{\an8}[Dex] Well, another clinch.

870
00:40:43,174 --> 00:40:45,143
{\an8}- [bell rings]
- [person 2] All right.

871
00:40:45,209 --> 00:40:46,811
[audience applauding]

872
00:40:51,382 --> 00:40:54,218
[Dex]
He's a lot more cautious than I expected.

873
00:40:54,285 --> 00:40:55,653
- You can tell.
- [Lee] Yeah.

874
00:40:55,720 --> 00:40:58,323
He's not just flat-out brawling.

875
00:40:58,389 --> 00:41:00,525
- He respects the skill level.
- [Jongkook] Right, right.

876
00:41:01,526 --> 00:41:04,295
When you step out and he comes back in,

877
00:41:04,362 --> 00:41:06,631
- I told you to read his moves.
- Right.

878
00:41:06,698 --> 00:41:08,633
[Chongpal]
Does he throw a jab or straight first?

879
00:41:08,700 --> 00:41:09,968
You strike when he does.

880
00:41:10,034 --> 00:41:12,203
[Hyunman]
<i>I need to put my stamp on this fight.</i>

881
00:41:12,270 --> 00:41:14,706
If you wrestle him,
you'll gas yourself out.

882
00:41:14,772 --> 00:41:16,240
Just pivot out and punch.

883
00:41:16,307 --> 00:41:18,576
He keeps grabbing me,
putting his arm around.

884
00:41:18,643 --> 00:41:19,644
But I'll try.

885
00:41:19,711 --> 00:41:22,981
[Sungmin] <i>The plan was to slip as much
as I can and just let my hands go.</i>

886
00:41:23,748 --> 00:41:28,286
[Seungheon] Myung Hyunman has made
his game plan clear early on.

887
00:41:28,353 --> 00:41:29,354
[whistle blows]

888
00:41:29,420 --> 00:41:32,590
[Seungheon] We'll see
how Hong Sungmin responds to that

889
00:41:32,657 --> 00:41:34,792
going into the second round.

890
00:41:34,859 --> 00:41:36,027
{\an8}[bell rings]

891
00:41:36,094 --> 00:41:37,095
{\an8}[referee] Box!

892
00:41:37,161 --> 00:41:41,332
{\an8}MYUNG HYUNMAN X HONG SUNGMIN

893
00:41:42,100 --> 00:41:44,569
[person] Myung Hyunman, let's go!

894
00:41:47,505 --> 00:41:48,873
[referee] No clinching.

895
00:41:50,041 --> 00:41:51,776
[Lee] He's got that head locked in tight.

896
00:41:51,843 --> 00:41:54,112
If you keep getting clinched up like that,

897
00:41:54,178 --> 00:41:55,713
your stamina drains fast.

898
00:41:57,482 --> 00:41:58,549
[Jongkook] Hey.

899
00:42:00,818 --> 00:42:02,854
[Hyunman] <i>The idea is to sap his energy
in the clinch,</i>

900
00:42:02,920 --> 00:42:04,489
<i>then start dealing damage.</i>

901
00:42:06,858 --> 00:42:08,659
- Stop!
- [person 1] Man, he's strong.

902
00:42:10,395 --> 00:42:13,164
[person 2] When someone much bigger
presses you down, your hands are tied.

903
00:42:13,231 --> 00:42:14,565
[person 3] He's being forced to squat.

904
00:42:15,566 --> 00:42:17,301
[sighs]

905
00:42:17,368 --> 00:42:18,870
[Dex] Sungmin needs to step it up now.

906
00:42:19,504 --> 00:42:22,140
- [person 1] Let's go, Sungmin!
- [audience gasps]

907
00:42:26,210 --> 00:42:28,613
[person 2] Don't go in straight!
Wait for it, then strike!

908
00:42:28,679 --> 00:42:29,981
[Seungheon] Another clinch.

909
00:42:30,048 --> 00:42:31,482
[Jihyun] Sungmin, get out of it!

910
00:42:34,886 --> 00:42:37,889
[Seungheon] Even in a clinch,
Hong is trying to work his own shots.

911
00:42:38,523 --> 00:42:40,758
[Sungmin]
<i>I figured I'd just take the fight inside.</i>

912
00:42:42,927 --> 00:42:44,996
- [Seungheon] And he's pushed off.
- [Lee] That's it.

913
00:42:46,798 --> 00:42:48,332
[Seungheon]
Hong Sungmin gets right to work.

914
00:42:48,399 --> 00:42:50,735
Once again,
Myung Hyunman goes for the clinch.

915
00:42:55,773 --> 00:42:57,275
- [Dex] Oh.
- [audience gasps]

916
00:42:57,842 --> 00:42:59,477
- [person 1] All right!
- [applause]

917
00:42:59,544 --> 00:43:01,479
[Jihyun] Hey, get out of there! Yes!

918
00:43:02,413 --> 00:43:03,614
- [person 2] Wow.
- [audience gasps]

919
00:43:03,681 --> 00:43:05,950
[Sungmin] <i>When he tried to clinch,
I lowered my level and slipped.</i>

920
00:43:07,018 --> 00:43:09,487
[Seungheon] Hong Sungmin is coming at him
with those combos!

921
00:43:16,360 --> 00:43:17,728
[Jongkook] Look at him using his knees.

922
00:43:18,296 --> 00:43:21,466
- [person 3] Let's go, Hyunman!
- [person 4] You got this!

923
00:43:21,532 --> 00:43:23,868
[person 5] Sungmin, work the combos!
Throw two at a time!

924
00:43:25,103 --> 00:43:26,104
That's it! Two!

925
00:43:26,170 --> 00:43:27,305
[gasping]

926
00:43:32,910 --> 00:43:35,146
[Seungheon] Ah! Look at Hong Sungmin go!

