00:56:30,621 --> 00:56:32,256
weighing in at 70 kg.

1156
00:56:32,322 --> 00:56:35,592
The 2024 National Sports Festival
welterweight boxing gold medalist.

1157
00:56:36,393 --> 00:56:38,562
From the Hwasun County boxing team,

1158
00:56:38,629 --> 00:56:41,031
<i>I Am Boxer's</i> top infighter!

1159
00:56:41,098 --> 00:56:43,033
A master of brutal body shots!

1160
00:56:43,100 --> 00:56:44,968
Please give it up for Body Killer!

1161
00:56:45,035 --> 00:56:48,038
- Kuk Seungjun!
- [audience cheering, applauding]

1162
00:56:48,105 --> 00:56:51,541
[Seungheon] He drew attention early on
because of his looks,

1163
00:56:51,608 --> 00:56:56,179
but he's now considered
the most improved fighter on <i>I Am Boxer</i>.

1164
00:56:57,881 --> 00:57:00,517
[Jongkook] In the red corner,
wearing the black trunks.

1165
00:57:00,584 --> 00:57:04,087
Standing 179 cm tall,

1166
00:57:04,154 --> 00:57:06,890
weighing in at 71 kg.

1167
00:57:06,957 --> 00:57:09,860
The 2024 Korean Boxing Association
President's Cup,

1168
00:57:09,927 --> 00:57:11,628
welterweight gold medalist!

1169
00:57:11,695 --> 00:57:14,131
A member of the KAFAC,

1170
00:57:15,565 --> 00:57:18,302
<i>I Am Boxer's</i> top technician!

1171
00:57:18,902 --> 00:57:20,704
A boxing machine, cool under pressure!

1172
00:57:20,771 --> 00:57:23,140
And the crown prince of the ring!

1173
00:57:25,175 --> 00:57:27,444
Please give it up for Prince!

1174
00:57:27,511 --> 00:57:31,214
- Lee Chaehyun!
- [audience cheering, applauding]

1175
00:57:31,281 --> 00:57:32,316
Salute!

1176
00:57:32,950 --> 00:57:37,721
[Gyuwon] Lee Chaehyun never loses
his balance, no matter the moment.

1177
00:57:37,788 --> 00:57:40,857
He is a fighter
with unshakable conviction!

1178
00:57:42,559 --> 00:57:45,629
[Dex] Let's hear from the fighters
before the bout.

1179
00:57:46,163 --> 00:57:50,434
Out of 90 fighters, only two remain.

1180
00:57:51,134 --> 00:57:55,272
I'll show you exactly
why I deserve to be in the finals

1181
00:57:55,339 --> 00:57:59,042
right here in this ring.

1182
00:58:01,111 --> 00:58:02,512
[person] Let's go!

1183
00:58:03,080 --> 00:58:06,116
Let me just say one thing to Lee Chaehyun.

1184
00:58:07,417 --> 00:58:10,520
Your punches looked a little light.

1185
00:58:11,621 --> 00:58:13,023
[audience gasps]

1186
00:58:13,590 --> 00:58:14,658
[person] Ouch!

1187
00:58:14,725 --> 00:58:16,660
That must've struck a nerve.

1188
00:58:16,727 --> 00:58:19,930
You're not putting me down with that.

1189
00:58:20,430 --> 00:58:23,767
I'll win by KO and take the belt.

1190
00:58:23,834 --> 00:58:25,402
[audience gasps]

1191
00:58:27,604 --> 00:58:30,707
You said my punching power's weak?

1192
00:58:30,774 --> 00:58:34,911
- Every time you blink, I land one.
- [chuckles]

1193
00:58:35,679 --> 00:58:36,880
[audience laughing]

1194
00:58:37,948 --> 00:58:39,916
So keep your eyes wide open.

1195
00:58:39,983 --> 00:58:41,051
[exclaiming]

1196
00:58:41,618 --> 00:58:44,087
- Burn!
- That is bold!

1197
00:58:44,154 --> 00:58:48,225
I'm going to light this arena up tonight.

1198
00:58:48,291 --> 00:58:51,428
So watch me go all in till the end!

1199
00:58:51,495 --> 00:58:52,796
[audience cheering, applauding]

1200
00:58:57,801 --> 00:59:01,171
I believe this fantastic matchup

1201
00:59:01,238 --> 00:59:03,373
will do the <i>I Am Boxer</i> finals justice.

1202
00:59:03,974 --> 00:59:05,242
This is it

1203
00:59:06,543 --> 00:59:07,911
for both fighters.

1204
00:59:08,979 --> 00:59:12,516
Leave everything you've got in the ring.

1205
00:59:12,582 --> 00:59:14,551
- [person 1] Let's go!
- [person 2] Let's go, Chaehyun!

1206
00:59:15,118 --> 00:59:16,787
[person 3] Let's go, Seungjun!

1207
00:59:17,654 --> 00:59:19,122
[Lee, Jongkook] Good luck, you two.

1208
00:59:20,257 --> 00:59:21,758
[person 1] You got this, Seungjun!

1209
00:59:21,825 --> 00:59:22,959
[person 2] Let's go, Chaehyun!

1210
00:59:23,460 --> 00:59:24,528
They look so young.

1211
00:59:24,594 --> 00:59:25,762
They must be really good.

1212
00:59:26,863 --> 00:59:30,667
{\an8}Fight like everyone here is on your side,

1213
00:59:30,734 --> 00:59:32,202
{\an8}because they are, okay?

1214
00:59:32,269 --> 00:59:33,770
{\an8}SHIN JONGHUN
2014 ASIAN GAMES GOLD MEDALIST

1215
00:59:34,471 --> 00:59:37,741
{\an8}Chaehyun,
keep it chill in the first round.

1216
00:59:37,808 --> 00:59:39,876
{\an8}Remember, tap-tap, pick your shots.

1217
00:59:39,943 --> 00:59:41,445
Slip it and go, got it?

1218
00:59:43,046 --> 00:59:46,349
Since it's the finals,
let's fight with no regrets, you two.

1219
00:59:46,416 --> 00:59:47,951
- Yes, sir.
- All right, glove touch.

1220
00:59:48,018 --> 00:59:49,019
Back to your corners.

1221
00:59:52,589 --> 00:59:56,626
{\an8}Sixty years ago,
Korea's first world champion,

1222
00:59:56,693 --> 01:00:00,964
{\an8}Kim Kisoo, was crowned right here.

1223
01:00:01,031 --> 01:00:04,835
A new champion will be crowned here today!

1224
01:00:04,901 --> 01:00:07,337
- Let's hear it for both of them.
- [audience chanting]

1225
01:00:07,404 --> 01:00:10,140
- Lee Chaehyun! Lee Chaehyun!
- Kuk Seungjun! Kuk Seungjun!

1226
01:00:10,207 --> 01:00:15,178
[Seungheon] Which of these two fighters
will become the last survivor standing?

1227
01:00:18,081 --> 01:00:19,082
- Box!
- [bell rings]

1228
01:00:19,149 --> 01:00:20,183
{\an8}LEE CHAEHYUN X KUK SEUNGJUN

1229
01:00:20,250 --> 01:00:22,252
{\an8}[Seungheon] The first round
of this 10-rounder's underway!

1230
01:00:22,319 --> 01:00:24,654
{\an8}Kuk Seungjun and Lee Chaehyun
collide in the center!

1231
01:00:27,090 --> 01:00:28,225
[gasps]

1232
01:00:28,291 --> 01:00:29,826
Oh. He's coming out with an early rush.

1233
01:00:31,995 --> 01:00:35,031
[Gyuwon]
Ah, Kuk Seungjun is coming in wild!

1234
01:00:37,100 --> 01:00:39,302
[Seungheon] Kuk Seungjun
opens with the body, his specialty.

1235
01:00:40,737 --> 01:00:42,339
[Seungjun] <i>I knew Lee Chaehyun well.</i>

1236
01:00:42,405 --> 01:00:46,309
<i>So I knew he'd try
to read the situation first.</i>

1237
01:00:46,376 --> 01:00:49,179
<i>That's why I decided to apply pressure
and step right in.</i>

1238
01:00:50,313 --> 01:00:52,482
[Seungheon] Nice body shot!
And in with the combos!

1239
01:00:52,549 --> 01:00:54,184
{\an8}- That's it!
- Oh!

1240
01:00:59,422 --> 01:01:01,024
- [coach] Chaehyun, stay calm!
- [referee] Stop!

1241
01:01:01,091 --> 01:01:03,693
[Jongkook] He's good.
No need to match his pace.

1242
01:01:03,760 --> 01:01:04,761
Box!

1243
01:01:07,197 --> 01:01:11,001
[Seungheon] It's a blistering first round
between Kuk Seungjun and Lee Chaehyun.

1244
01:01:11,735 --> 01:01:13,637
[audience gasps]

1245
01:01:14,771 --> 01:01:16,206
[audience gasps]

1246
01:01:16,273 --> 01:01:17,440
- It's fine!
- Slip!

1247
01:01:17,507 --> 01:01:18,975
Chaehyun, breathe!

1248
01:01:19,042 --> 01:01:20,477
[referee] No pushing.

1249
01:01:20,544 --> 01:01:21,978
Chaehyun, stay calm!

1250
01:01:23,280 --> 01:01:24,281
[referee] Box!

1251
01:01:28,585 --> 01:01:31,821
[Chaehyun]
<i>Seungjun was coming in really wild.</i>

1252
01:01:33,256 --> 01:01:34,691
[person] Nice going!

1253
01:01:35,692 --> 01:01:39,396
[Chaehyun] <i>So I figured I'd hold my ground
and counter him instead.</i>

1254
01:01:41,097 --> 01:01:43,033
[audience gasps]

1255
01:01:43,099 --> 01:01:44,401
Hey!

1256
01:01:44,467 --> 01:01:45,902
He fired right back immediately.

1257
01:01:47,537 --> 01:01:49,940
[Gyuwon]
Kuk Seungjun is coming in wide and low.

1258
01:01:50,006 --> 01:01:53,910
And Lee Chaehyun is staying
on the defensive, looking to counter.

1259
01:01:53,977 --> 01:01:55,612
[Jonghun] It's just the first round!

1260
01:01:55,679 --> 01:01:57,113
Keep your lead hand forward!

1261
01:01:57,180 --> 01:01:59,216
[person 1] Throw with him!

1262
01:01:59,282 --> 01:02:00,550
[person 2] All right!

1263
01:02:02,752 --> 01:02:04,287
[♪ exciting music playing]

1264
01:02:05,188 --> 01:02:06,489
[audience exclaiming]

1265
01:02:09,326 --> 01:02:10,327
He's pressing hard.

1266
01:02:10,393 --> 01:02:11,861
- [person] Pushing for an early finish.
- Yeah.

1267
01:02:14,130 --> 01:02:17,434
[Gyuwon] It's a fierce battle
of tactics and physicality.

1268
01:02:17,500 --> 01:02:21,004
Both fighters are engaging in
an energy-draining close-range fight.

1269
01:02:21,071 --> 01:02:23,940
[Seungheon] This is unlike anything
we've seen from them before.

1270
01:02:24,007 --> 01:02:26,876
Both fighters are coming out hot
from the opening bell!

1271
01:02:29,913 --> 01:02:31,481
[Dex] Oh, that body shot landed clean! Oh.

1272
01:02:31,548 --> 01:02:33,950
- They keep this up, 10 round's a stretch.
- Right?

1273
01:02:34,017 --> 01:02:36,419
[coach] Chaehyun, he's coming in!
He's coming in!

1274
01:02:36,486 --> 01:02:38,588
[person 1] Fire from where you are!
That's it!

1275
01:02:40,557 --> 01:02:43,159
[audience gasps]

1276
01:02:44,995 --> 01:02:47,631
[Seungheon] There's that body shot!
Kuk pushes him back against the ropes!

1277
01:02:47,697 --> 01:02:48,865
And he comes in!

1278
01:02:50,667 --> 01:02:52,636
{\an8}[♪ suspenseful music playing]

1279
01:03:00,477 --> 01:03:01,678
{\an8}- You have to go now!
- [bell rings]

1280
01:03:01,745 --> 01:03:03,113
{\an8}Stop!

1281
01:03:03,179 --> 01:03:05,849
[Seungheon]
That brings the first round to a close.

1282
01:03:06,449 --> 01:03:07,651
Hey, deep breaths.

1283
01:03:07,717 --> 01:03:10,887
[Gyuwon] Wow.
What a nail-biter of a first round.

1284
01:03:10,954 --> 01:03:14,391
You can feel their hunger for that belt!

1285
01:03:14,457 --> 01:03:16,860
- Let's go, Chaehyun!
- Let's go, Chaehyun!

1286
01:03:17,661 --> 01:03:19,195
Man, they're going wild in there.

1287
01:03:19,262 --> 01:03:21,464
Chaehyun's probably a little rattled.

1288
01:03:21,531 --> 01:03:23,767
He probably didn't expect Seungjun
to come out so strong.

1289
01:03:23,833 --> 01:03:26,536
Because they've fought before.

1290
01:03:26,603 --> 01:03:28,271
- They know each other's styles.
- Right.

1291
01:03:28,338 --> 01:03:30,640
He probably didn't think
he'd come out this aggressively.

1292
01:03:30,707 --> 01:03:32,008
[Jongkook] That's what it feels like.

1293
01:03:32,075 --> 01:03:33,476
You're doing so well.

1294
01:03:33,543 --> 01:03:35,679
But let's just stay a bit calmer.

1295
01:03:35,745 --> 01:03:37,781
This is just the first round, okay?

1296
01:03:38,348 --> 01:03:39,516
Feeling-out's done, yeah?

1297
01:03:40,083 --> 01:03:43,586
[Seungjun] <i>I think I gained confidence
by winning the early momentum battle.</i>

1298
01:03:43,653 --> 01:03:46,523
<i>I used a lot of unconventional punches.</i>

1299
01:03:46,589 --> 01:03:49,359
<i>Lee Chaehyun looked really shaken by that.</i>

1300
01:03:49,859 --> 01:03:52,262
<i>So I thought, "My strategy's working."</i>

1301
01:03:52,329 --> 01:03:53,897
<i>"Let's keep it going like this."</i>

1302
01:03:54,964 --> 01:03:56,966
[coach] No need to rush.

1303
01:03:57,033 --> 01:03:59,602
Don't hesitate like this.
If he comes in, just throw.

1304
01:03:59,669 --> 01:04:01,671
Tap-tap-tap! Just like that, okay?

1305
01:04:01,738 --> 01:04:03,306
Stick to this rhythm, okay?

1306
01:04:03,373 --> 01:04:04,974
Don't get dragged into
Seungjun's rhythm, okay?

1307
01:04:05,041 --> 01:04:06,042
- Yes.
- [whistle blows]

1308
01:04:06,109 --> 01:04:08,745
[Chaehyun]
<i>I told myself not to get pulled into</i>

1309
01:04:08,812 --> 01:04:10,747
<i>Seungjun's wild attacks
and physical battles.</i>

1310
01:04:10,814 --> 01:04:12,148
<i>"Just do what I need to do."</i>

1311
01:04:12,215 --> 01:04:14,617
<i>I knew I had to crush him
in the second round.</i>

1312
01:04:15,919 --> 01:04:17,787
{\an8}[Seungheon]
Let's see how this round unfolds.

1313
01:04:17,854 --> 01:04:20,156
{\an8}The second round is about to begin.

1314
01:04:20,757 --> 01:04:23,993
- Let's go, Chaehyun!
- Let's go, Chaehyun!

1315
01:04:24,060 --> 01:04:25,729
You can do this, Seungjun!

1316
01:04:27,097 --> 01:04:29,032
{\an8}- [bell rings]
- [referee] All right, box!

1317
01:04:29,099 --> 01:04:30,400
{\an8}[Seungheon] The second round's begun.

1318
01:04:30,467 --> 01:04:33,069
{\an8}LEE CHAEHYUN X KUK SEUNGJUN

1319
01:04:34,204 --> 01:04:36,406
[Seungheon] Lee Chaehyun jabs,
not missing that open guard.

1320
01:04:36,473 --> 01:04:37,474
Oh, boy.

1321
01:04:39,642 --> 01:04:42,379
[Seungheon] Kuk's really moving
his upper body. And he lands one upstairs!

1322
01:04:42,445 --> 01:04:43,780
{\an8}- Oh!
- Oh!

1323
01:04:43,847 --> 01:04:46,549
You get caught by those shots
you don't see coming.

1324
01:04:48,218 --> 01:04:50,687
[audience gasping]

1325
01:04:50,754 --> 01:04:53,857
[Gyuwon] Kuk Seungjun is definitely
making use of his reach advantage

1326
01:04:53,923 --> 01:04:56,259
to dominate the opponent,

1327
01:04:56,326 --> 01:04:59,462
making him even more dangerous
and harder to find the range on.

1328
01:04:59,529 --> 01:05:00,830
[Jongkook] Nice double combo.

1329
01:05:00,897 --> 01:05:03,233
Seungjun's not giving him
any distance at all.

1330
01:05:04,000 --> 01:05:05,435
[Chaehyun] <i>Distance-wise,</i>

1331
01:05:06,336 --> 01:05:08,304
<i>it was hard to find my range.</i>

1332
01:05:10,173 --> 01:05:12,208
- [spectator 1] Go lower!
- [spectator 2] Lower your aim!

1333
01:05:12,275 --> 01:05:16,112
[Chaehyun] <i>He kept his arms fully extended
to maintain as much distance as possible.</i>

1334
01:05:16,179 --> 01:05:17,480
[spectator] Don't fall back!

1335
01:05:20,016 --> 01:05:22,152
<i>So I timed the body when he came in.</i>

1336
01:05:22,218 --> 01:05:24,888
[Seungheon] Lee Chaehyun strikes the body
and quickly gets out.

1337
01:05:24,954 --> 01:05:26,256
[spectator] Just keep going!

1338
01:05:29,058 --> 01:05:31,594
Hey, that body shot connected!

1339
01:05:31,661 --> 01:05:33,496
- That's it!
- There you go!

1340
01:05:33,563 --> 01:05:35,999
[coach] Just fight your fight, Chaehyun!

1341
01:05:36,065 --> 01:05:38,268
[Gyuwon] Lee Chaehyun's jab
isn't just a jab.

1342
01:05:38,334 --> 01:05:40,737
It sets up his counter,

1343
01:05:40,804 --> 01:05:42,672
which is his most dangerous weapon.

1344
01:05:43,840 --> 01:05:44,974
[spectator] That's it!

1345
01:05:45,041 --> 01:05:46,342
[exclaiming]

1346
01:05:46,409 --> 01:05:47,677
Work the body!

1347
01:05:49,879 --> 01:05:51,714
[Seungheon] Kuk comes in
with upper-body movement.

1348
01:06:01,458 --> 01:06:02,559
And right on cue,

1349
01:06:02,625 --> 01:06:04,694
Lee plants a counter with a sharp left.

1350
01:06:04,761 --> 01:06:06,463
[Lee] See that?
He waits for it, then throws.

1351
01:06:06,529 --> 01:06:08,298
That means
Seungjun shouldn't swing too big.

1352
01:06:08,865 --> 01:06:11,134
- Slow down.
- [Seungjun's father] Take your time, son!

1353
01:06:11,835 --> 01:06:13,770
[coach] This is it! Work the body!

1354
01:06:14,671 --> 01:06:17,674
[Seungheon] Lee Chaehyun seems to
have gotten a read

1355
01:06:17,740 --> 01:06:21,311
on Kuk Seungjun's entry timing this round.

1356
01:06:23,713 --> 01:06:25,014
{\an8}[spectator] That's it!

1357
01:06:27,951 --> 01:06:29,118
Man, that's great.

1358
01:06:29,185 --> 01:06:30,820
That counter was really good.

1359
01:06:32,288 --> 01:06:34,090
{\an8}[spectator] All right!

1360
01:06:35,525 --> 01:06:37,260
{\an8}- Break! Break!
- [bell dings]

1361
01:06:37,327 --> 01:06:38,695
{\an8}- Stop!
- Okay.

1362
01:06:40,129 --> 01:06:42,599
[Gyuwon] Since the opening round,

1363
01:06:42,665 --> 01:06:46,636
Kuk Seungjun has been trying to dominate

1364
01:06:46,703 --> 01:06:49,172
with his wild infighting style.

1365
01:06:49,239 --> 01:06:51,174
But Lee Chaehyun is extremely composed.

1366
01:06:51,241 --> 01:06:52,976
He's not letting that happen.

1367
01:06:53,710 --> 01:06:55,144
You're doing well, Chaehyun.

1368
01:06:55,211 --> 01:06:57,146
Bam, bam. They're all landing.

1369
01:06:57,213 --> 01:07:00,083
Don't look too high.
Look toward the chest and drive it in.

1370
01:07:00,149 --> 01:07:01,584
Chaehyun is staying calm,

1371
01:07:01,651 --> 01:07:03,486
picking his shots here and there.

1372
01:07:03,553 --> 01:07:06,656
The thing is,
Seungjun's short punches aren't landing.

1373
01:07:06,723 --> 01:07:09,559
They keep sailing past Chaehyun's head.

1374
01:07:10,727 --> 01:07:13,496
Shorten your punches just a bit.
The big ones aren't landing.

1375
01:07:13,563 --> 01:07:15,765
He's watching you, and he's not tired yet.

1376
01:07:15,832 --> 01:07:16,900
So nothing's landing.

1377
01:07:16,966 --> 01:07:19,402
That's why you gotta keep it short, okay?

1378
01:07:23,172 --> 01:07:29,412
{\an8}BOXING SCORE CARD
LEE: 19, KUK: 19

1379
01:07:30,346 --> 01:07:32,348
{\an8}- Okay, box!
- [Seungheon] Moving into the third round.

1380
01:07:32,415 --> 01:07:34,083
{\an8}LEE CHAEHYUN X KUK SEUNGJUN

1381
01:07:34,150 --> 01:07:35,685
{\an8}- [spectator 1] Here he comes!
- [spectator 2] Okay, go in!

1382
01:07:35,752 --> 01:07:36,886
Keep it short!

1383
01:07:36,953 --> 01:07:39,055
[Seungheon] Kuk lands on the body,
and Lee pushes forward.

1384
01:07:41,324 --> 01:07:43,192
Kuk stays on him, targeting the body.

1385
01:07:43,259 --> 01:07:44,260
[spectator] All right!

1386
01:07:44,761 --> 01:07:48,131
[Gyuwon] This is an intense battle
of rhythm and tactics.

1387
01:07:51,267 --> 01:07:52,702
[Seungheon] Look at Chaehyun running.

1388
01:07:52,769 --> 01:07:55,605
[spectator 1] That's it! Go for it!

1389
01:07:55,672 --> 01:07:56,706
[spectator 2] There you go!

1390
01:07:59,509 --> 01:08:02,312
[Seungheon] Kuk comes in,
goes to the body, then exits.

1391
01:08:05,648 --> 01:08:07,517
Lee is inviting Kuk to come closer.

1392
01:08:08,751 --> 01:08:10,787
And Kuk Seungjun responds
without backing away.

1393
01:08:11,888 --> 01:08:12,922
They're locked in close.

1394
01:08:14,123 --> 01:08:15,925
[referee] Okay, break, break, break!

1395
01:08:16,793 --> 01:08:18,995
We're seeing
a lot of passionate exchanges here.

1396
01:08:20,229 --> 01:08:22,332
Save your energy! Save it!

1397
01:08:24,100 --> 01:08:27,704
Chaehyun probably planned
to pace himself for a typical 10-rounder.

1398
01:08:29,238 --> 01:08:33,776
But Seungjun keeps pressing,
so he has to match his pace.

1399
01:08:33,843 --> 01:08:35,812
He's coming, Chaehyun! He's coming in!

1400
01:08:43,519 --> 01:08:45,588
[Seungheon] Lee charges in,
looking to make a statement.

1401
01:08:46,456 --> 01:08:47,457
And that's it!

1402
01:08:47,523 --> 01:08:48,591
[audience gasping]

1403
01:08:51,260 --> 01:08:53,663
[Gyuwon] What a clean counter!

1404
01:08:53,730 --> 01:08:55,932
That's timing at its finest!

1405
01:08:56,766 --> 01:08:59,068
That's it! There you go!

1406
01:09:03,106 --> 01:09:04,240
{\an8}- [bell dings]
- Stop!

1407
01:09:04,307 --> 01:09:06,376
{\an8}And that ends the round.

1408
01:09:06,442 --> 01:09:07,443
[♪ majestic music playing]

1409
01:09:07,510 --> 01:09:09,545
[Chaehyun]
<i>I felt like I won the third round,</i>

1410
01:09:09,612 --> 01:09:11,314
<i>so I let the crowd know.</i>

1411
01:09:11,381 --> 01:09:13,516
- <i>That I'd won the round.</i>
- [Chaehyun's mother] You did so well!

1412
01:09:14,984 --> 01:09:16,653
He's good. He's real good.

1413
01:09:18,488 --> 01:09:20,023
[audience cheering, applauding]

1414
01:09:22,458 --> 01:09:23,493
Deep breaths!

1415
01:09:24,494 --> 01:09:26,729
Everything was good,
except getting caught at the end.

1416
01:09:26,796 --> 01:09:27,930
It's okay. Deep breaths.

1417
01:09:28,598 --> 01:09:29,666
Just keep going.

1418
01:09:30,433 --> 01:09:31,634
[Seungjun] <i>This won't do.</i>

1419
01:09:32,635 --> 01:09:34,504
Remember? He always jabs and slips out.

1420
01:09:34,570 --> 01:09:36,372
That's when you need to drive it in.

1421
01:09:36,439 --> 01:09:37,840
Stick to what we practiced.

1422
01:09:37,907 --> 01:09:39,876
[Seungjun] <i>Once I get worked up,
I don't hear a thing.</i>

1423
01:09:40,376 --> 01:09:41,844
<i>I just block everything out.</i>

1424
01:09:45,348 --> 01:09:50,153
{\an8}BOXING SCORE CARD
LEE: 29, KUK: 28

1425
01:09:50,219 --> 01:09:52,789
{\an8}- [bell dings]
- Okay, box!

1426
01:09:53,656 --> 01:09:54,824
{\an8}[Seungheon] The next round begins.

1427
01:09:54,891 --> 01:09:57,293
[coach] Don't wait for it! Just go!

1428
01:09:57,994 --> 01:09:59,729
[audience exclaiming]

1429
01:10:01,664 --> 01:10:02,965
[groans]

1430
01:10:07,036 --> 01:10:09,338
- [coach] Chaehyun, he's turning it up now!
- Break, break!

1431
01:10:09,405 --> 01:10:10,740
He's coming in hard now!

1432
01:10:11,741 --> 01:10:17,013
[Gyuwon] I bet they've never had to do
this much hand fighting and clinch work.

1433
01:10:17,580 --> 01:10:18,681
[Seungheon] They're in a clinch.

1434
01:10:19,282 --> 01:10:21,417
Both fighters are throwing nonstop.

1435
01:10:22,118 --> 01:10:23,886
[Jonghoon] Keep it short, damn it!

1436
01:10:23,953 --> 01:10:25,455
[Lee] Seungjun needs to go short.

1437
01:10:25,521 --> 01:10:26,823
Break it up!

1438
01:10:27,323 --> 01:10:29,025
Too big! Make it shorter!

1439
01:10:29,092 --> 01:10:30,827
- Slow it down, son!
- Slow down.

1440
01:10:30,893 --> 01:10:32,628
Hey, no holding.

1441
01:10:33,229 --> 01:10:34,230
Slip!

1442
01:10:34,297 --> 01:10:36,399
Hey, you have to focus.

1443
01:10:37,033 --> 01:10:39,335
[Seungjun] <i>When things started to
get heated,</i>

1444
01:10:39,402 --> 01:10:41,270
<i>it stopped going the way I planned.</i>

1445
01:10:43,039 --> 01:10:44,340
<i>Then I started to wonder,</i>

1446
01:10:44,407 --> 01:10:47,176
<i>"Do I keep pressing?
Or do I wait for the right timing?"</i>

1447
01:10:48,244 --> 01:10:49,312
<i>"Can I win this?"</i>

1448
01:10:51,881 --> 01:10:55,551
[Seungheon] Once again, Lee holds
the center, and Kuk needs to move in.

1449
01:10:56,486 --> 01:11:01,290
<i>But I constantly tried not to let
those thoughts take over.</i>

1450
01:11:01,958 --> 01:11:04,460
[♪ thrilling music playing]

1451
01:11:05,027 --> 01:11:07,296
<i>"I can win. I can do this."</i>

1452
01:11:14,737 --> 01:11:16,372
[audience exclaiming]

1453
01:11:17,874 --> 01:11:20,476
- Oh! That landed!
- [Dex] His head popped up!

1454
01:11:23,346 --> 01:11:24,614
<i>"That landed."</i>

1455
01:11:24,680 --> 01:11:26,549
<i>"Time to bring it back to my pace."</i>

1456
01:11:29,285 --> 01:11:31,821
[Seungheon] Kuk Seungjun's punches
are starting to get through here.

1457
01:11:32,922 --> 01:11:36,225
- He's getting clipped!
- Chaehyun's vulnerable on the pullback.

1458
01:11:36,292 --> 01:11:37,994
Seungjun's doing well this round.

1459
01:11:38,060 --> 01:11:42,331
[Gyuwon] Those unconventional attacks are
creating that one percent chance.

1460
01:11:42,398 --> 01:11:44,567
{\an8}LEE CHAEHYUN X KUK SEUNGJUN

1461
01:11:44,634 --> 01:11:46,569
{\an8}- Let's go, Chaehyun!
- Let's go, Chaehyun!

1462
01:11:46,636 --> 01:11:48,704
{\an8}[Seungjun's sister] That's it!
Keep it up, Seungjun!

1463
01:11:52,275 --> 01:11:53,943
{\an8}- [bell dings]
- Stop! Stop, stop!

1464
01:11:54,010 --> 01:11:57,346
[Gyuwon] And the round comes to an end.

1465
01:11:58,214 --> 01:12:00,049
Man, that's intense.

1466
01:12:00,550 --> 01:12:01,884
This is the finals, all right.

1467
01:12:01,951 --> 01:12:03,953
- Chaehyun's usually hard to touch.
- [Lee] Totally.

1468
01:12:04,020 --> 01:12:05,755
[Dex] Will it be Chaehyun's timing
and control?

1469
01:12:06,923 --> 01:12:08,457
Or Seungjun's all-out pressure?

1470
01:12:09,892 --> 01:12:12,028
{\an8}- Round 5 is where it really begins.
- That's right.

1471
01:12:12,595 --> 01:12:14,897
[coach] Chaehyun, don't get greedy, okay?

1472
01:12:14,964 --> 01:12:16,632
You can take it easy.

1473
01:12:16,699 --> 01:12:17,967
Fight with confidence.

1474
01:12:18,034 --> 01:12:19,135
[♪ heavy music playing]

1475
01:12:19,202 --> 01:12:20,703
Let's go, Chaehyun!

1476
01:12:22,438 --> 01:12:24,607
[Chaehyun] <i>I felt I got pushed back
a bit in Round 4,</i>

1477
01:12:24,674 --> 01:12:26,442
<i>so I knew I had to win the next one.</i>

1478
01:12:26,943 --> 01:12:28,945
[Seungjun] <i>From here on out,
I have to take all the rounds.</i>

1479
01:12:29,512 --> 01:12:30,813
<i>I have to keep winning.</i>

1480
01:12:32,114 --> 01:12:34,050
{\an8}- [bell dings]
- [Seungheon] The fifth round has begun.

1481
01:12:34,116 --> 01:12:37,153
{\an8}- Box!
- [Gyuwon] This round's where it gets real.

1482
01:12:39,288 --> 01:12:41,023
When they're feinting their way in,

1483
01:12:41,090 --> 01:12:44,193
it's about who breaks the rhythm first.

1484
01:12:44,260 --> 01:12:46,195
- Break, break!
- [Dex] Clinching really drains you.

1485
01:12:46,262 --> 01:12:47,530
It's pretty exhausting.

1486
01:12:47,597 --> 01:12:49,398
It must feel brutal right now.

1487
01:12:49,465 --> 01:12:51,234
[coach] Okay, plant your feet and fire!

1488
01:12:51,868 --> 01:12:53,269
[Seungheon] Lee Chaehyun steps in
this time.

1489
01:12:54,103 --> 01:12:56,172
Sticking to the stick-and-move tactic.

1490
01:12:58,741 --> 01:13:00,610
As Lee backs out, Kuk closes back in.

1491
01:13:00,676 --> 01:13:01,944
[Jongkook] Throw back right away.

1492
01:13:03,713 --> 01:13:05,615
All right!

1493
01:13:05,681 --> 01:13:07,583
It's like watching a KNSF fight.

1494
01:13:10,853 --> 01:13:12,121
All right!

1495
01:13:12,188 --> 01:13:14,156
[coach] Pull your head out to the right!

1496
01:13:16,626 --> 01:13:17,927
[Lee] Hey...

1497
01:13:17,994 --> 01:13:19,395
Careful.

1498
01:13:19,462 --> 01:13:21,831
He keeps ramming his head in.

1499
01:13:21,898 --> 01:13:24,867
- Heads are getting dangerously close.
- Right.

1500
01:13:24,934 --> 01:13:27,003
That's not Chaehyun's normal style.

1501
01:13:32,141 --> 01:13:34,277
[Gyuwon] Kuk was setting up
this body shot!

1502
01:13:35,678 --> 01:13:36,679
[Dex] Nice body shot!

1503
01:13:36,746 --> 01:13:38,214
[Jongkook] He's starting
to work the body now.

1504
01:13:39,048 --> 01:13:40,716
[Lee] All right, careful now.

1505
01:13:45,521 --> 01:13:46,589
Huh?

1506
01:13:46,656 --> 01:13:47,924
Wait, hold on!

1507
01:13:48,658 --> 01:13:50,159
Hold on!

1508
01:13:50,226 --> 01:13:51,227
[exclaims]

1509
01:13:54,597 --> 01:13:55,865
Okay, stop, stop!

1510
01:13:55,932 --> 01:13:57,400
[Jongkook] Is there a cut? A loose tooth?

1511
01:13:58,067 --> 01:13:59,068
Is there a cut?

1512
01:13:59,135 --> 01:14:00,770
[Seungheon] There's a bit of a cut.

1513
01:14:00,836 --> 01:14:01,837
[referee] Time.

1514
01:14:01,904 --> 01:14:03,472
[Seungheon] This could change the game.

1515
01:14:04,407 --> 01:14:05,975
Boy, they headbutted.

1516
01:14:08,044 --> 01:14:10,379
That looks so painful. Oh, dear.

1517
01:14:10,446 --> 01:14:12,148
[coach] Ugh, damn it.

1518
01:14:14,684 --> 01:14:16,118
[Seungheon]
The doctor's examining the cut.

1519
01:14:16,185 --> 01:14:18,354
[Gyuwon] I hope it's not a serious injury.

1520
01:14:19,555 --> 01:14:21,657
We need to see how deep that cut is.

1521
01:14:21,724 --> 01:14:23,426
Their heads were just too close.

1522
01:14:23,492 --> 01:14:25,695
They kept ramming
their heads in like this.

1523
01:14:25,761 --> 01:14:27,163
[spectator] Stay strong, Chaehyun!

1524
01:14:27,229 --> 01:14:29,632
[Gyuwon] They've been fighting so roughly.

1525
01:14:30,433 --> 01:14:33,836
This kind of injury was bound to happen.

1526
01:14:34,403 --> 01:14:36,272
- I think the bleeding's stopping.
- Ah!

1527
01:14:38,040 --> 01:14:41,143
<i>I took a shot, then as Seungjun rushed in,</i>

1528
01:14:42,278 --> 01:14:44,880
<i>I tried to answer back the same way.</i>

1529
01:14:45,381 --> 01:14:47,650
<i>I got heated,
and that's when the headbutt happened.</i>

1530
01:14:49,218 --> 01:14:52,054
<i>And when I got cut, I felt it immediately.</i>

1531
01:14:53,155 --> 01:14:54,323
I was shocked.

1532
01:14:58,961 --> 01:15:00,896
<i>It didn't sit well with me.</i>

1533
01:15:03,232 --> 01:15:05,468
{\an8}Seungjun had a cut recently too.

1534
01:15:07,069 --> 01:15:08,637
{\an8}It breaks every mother's heart.

1535
01:15:09,171 --> 01:15:11,440
- Chaehyun's mom must be heartbroken.
- Right.

1536
01:15:12,508 --> 01:15:14,543
The bleeding seems to have stopped.

1537
01:15:15,144 --> 01:15:16,979
- How are you feeling, Chaehyun?
- I can go on.

1538
01:15:17,046 --> 01:15:18,447
You think so? All right.

1539
01:15:18,514 --> 01:15:21,884
[Chaehyun] <i>Cut or not,
I just hoped they don't stop the fight.</i>

1540
01:15:22,385 --> 01:15:24,186
[applause, cheering]

1541
01:15:25,121 --> 01:15:27,356
[Lee] He seems okay for now,

1542
01:15:27,923 --> 01:15:30,126
but we need to see if that cut opens up.

1543
01:15:30,826 --> 01:15:35,131
- Lee Chaehyun! Lee Chaehyun!
- Lee Chaehyun! Lee Chaehyun!

1544
01:15:35,197 --> 01:15:38,067
Can the fight continue
even if there's a bleeding?

1545
01:15:38,134 --> 01:15:40,569
[Jongkook] Yes, but if it's too much,
it gets stopped.

1546
01:15:41,871 --> 01:15:43,239
[Seungheon] Looks like we're resuming.

1547
01:15:44,407 --> 01:15:48,177
[Gyuwon] Lee Chaehyun has
incredible grit and will.

1548
01:15:53,082 --> 01:15:54,083
{\an8}Box!

1549
01:15:54,583 --> 01:15:55,785
{\an8}[Seungheon] The fight resumes.

1550
01:15:56,485 --> 01:15:57,753
Lee Chaehyun proceeds carefully.

1551
01:15:59,088 --> 01:16:02,858
If the cut worsens,
the fight could be stopped.

1552
01:16:03,726 --> 01:16:04,727
[Lee] Yes, that's it.

1553
01:16:04,794 --> 01:16:06,729
You've gotta rip, then get out.

1554
01:16:12,001 --> 01:16:13,736
Careful now. Let's keep going.

1555
01:16:19,341 --> 01:16:21,343
{\an8}LEE CHAEHYUN X KUK SEUNGJUN

1556
01:16:23,546 --> 01:16:26,449
[Seungheon] As Kuk steps in,
Lee lands a big shot to the face!

1557
01:16:28,884 --> 01:16:30,686
{\an8}[audience exclaims]

1558
01:16:34,423 --> 01:16:35,791
{\an8}- [bell dings]
- Stop!

1559
01:16:35,858 --> 01:16:39,795
{\an8}And just like that!
The fifth round has ended.

1560
01:16:41,831 --> 01:16:43,766
[Gyuwon] This could be a major factor

1561
01:16:43,833 --> 01:16:46,102
that might shift the entire flow.

1562
01:16:52,208 --> 01:16:53,209
You okay?

1563
01:16:54,910 --> 01:16:57,046
[Seungheon] The cut is in a tricky spot,

1564
01:16:57,113 --> 01:17:00,049
so there's a good chance
it could interfere with his vision.

1565
01:17:00,916 --> 01:17:03,185
[panting]

1566
01:17:09,625 --> 01:17:13,262
{\an8}BOXING SCORE CARD
LEE: 48, KUK: 47

1567
01:17:13,329 --> 01:17:16,832
{\an8}- Lee Chaehyun! Lee Chaehyun!
- Lee Chaehyun! Lee Chaehyun!

1568
01:17:16,899 --> 01:17:21,770
- Lee Chaehyun! Lee Chaehyun!
- Lee Chaehyun! Lee Chaehyun!

1569
01:17:21,837 --> 01:17:24,173
- Lee Chaehyun! Lee Chaehyun!
- Lee Chaehyun! Lee Chaehyun!

1570
01:17:24,240 --> 01:17:25,741
Breathe. It's fine.

1571
01:17:26,709 --> 01:17:28,377
Don't let it get to you.

1572
01:17:30,513 --> 01:17:32,982
[Seungjun] <i>I thought it was admirable</i>

1573
01:17:33,048 --> 01:17:34,150
that he decided to go on.

1574
01:17:36,051 --> 01:17:37,786
<i>I respected him for that.</i>

1575
01:17:37,853 --> 01:17:39,455
<i>From a sportsmanship standpoint,</i>

1576
01:17:40,422 --> 01:17:44,260
<i>I felt it was only right
to meet him head-on.</i>

1577
01:17:44,326 --> 01:17:46,729
Protect your head.
You can't afford to bleed now.

1578
01:17:47,463 --> 01:17:49,064
[Chaehyun] <i>Just because I'm cut</i>

1579
01:17:49,632 --> 01:17:52,168
<i>doesn't mean Seungjun's going
to go easy on me.</i>

1580
01:17:52,234 --> 01:17:54,670
<i>I had to win the next rounds,
no matter what.</i>

1581
01:17:54,737 --> 01:17:56,705
<i>So I kept praying it wouldn't be stopped.</i>

1582
01:17:56,772 --> 01:17:58,574
{\an8}- [bell dings]
- All right, box!

1583
01:17:58,641 --> 01:18:01,744
{\an8}[Seungheon] And now, it's the sixth round.

1584
01:18:01,810 --> 01:18:04,847
{\an8}LEE CHAEHYUN X KUK SEUNGJUN

1585
01:18:04,914 --> 01:18:06,415
[cheering]

1586
01:18:06,482 --> 01:18:09,351
Beautiful combinations from both fighters!

1587
01:18:09,418 --> 01:18:11,487
[♪ intense music playing]

1588
01:18:11,554 --> 01:18:13,656
Let's go, Chaehyun!

1589
01:18:16,659 --> 01:18:19,028
[coach] Chaehyun, protect your head!

1590
01:18:23,065 --> 01:18:24,133
Man, this is tough.

1591
01:18:33,342 --> 01:18:34,843
[Seungheon] It's the left hand this time!

1592
01:18:34,910 --> 01:18:36,078
Lee Chaehyun steps in!

1593
01:18:36,145 --> 01:18:37,446
And keeps charging forward!

1594
01:18:38,414 --> 01:18:39,481
[Jongkook] This is tough.

1595
01:18:39,548 --> 01:18:41,116
When you come in wild like that,

1596
01:18:41,183 --> 01:18:42,918
- you have to answer him.
- Right.

1597
01:18:42,985 --> 01:18:44,186
Break it up!

1598
01:18:45,654 --> 01:18:47,623
[Seungheon] There's still
a bit of bleeding there.

1599
01:18:49,625 --> 01:18:50,826
[coach] Stay sharp!

1600
01:18:51,694 --> 01:18:54,096
[Seungheon] He can't help
but be conscious of his left eye.

1601
01:18:56,398 --> 01:18:58,801
[Lee] With the blood,
his vision looks a bit compromised.

1602
01:19:02,037 --> 01:19:04,573
[Chaehyun] <i>Because of the cut,
I was bleeding quite a bit.</i>

1603
01:19:05,074 --> 01:19:06,809
<i>And it kept getting in my left eye.</i>

1604
01:19:10,179 --> 01:19:11,547
Oh, no.

1605
01:19:13,082 --> 01:19:15,184
[Seungheon]
With the blood impairing his left eye,

1606
01:19:15,251 --> 01:19:17,253
the distance game gets tricky.

1607
01:19:23,659 --> 01:19:25,060
[Chaehyun] <i>My mind was racing.</i>

1608
01:19:25,127 --> 01:19:26,428
<i>I needed to win,</i>

1609
01:19:27,229 --> 01:19:30,399
<i>but the cut was impossible to ignore
with all the bleeding.</i>

1610
01:19:31,000 --> 01:19:33,435
<i>I was completely overwhelmed.</i>

1611
01:19:41,210 --> 01:19:42,611
Okay, slip!

1612
01:19:45,648 --> 01:19:47,816
<i>But even though the cut kept bleeding,</i>

1613
01:19:48,517 --> 01:19:51,487
I really just wanted to win.

1614
01:19:52,621 --> 01:19:53,622
Box!

1615
01:19:53,689 --> 01:19:58,027
<i>So I told myself, "If I want to win,
I can't be worrying about this."</i>

1616
01:19:58,093 --> 01:20:00,095
<i>"Just focus on what I need to do."</i>

1617
01:20:00,663 --> 01:20:02,231
<i>So I charged forward with all I had.</i>

1618
01:20:03,032 --> 01:20:05,501
[Gyuwon] This has got to be
taking a toll on him mentally,

1619
01:20:05,567 --> 01:20:08,871
but Lee Chaehyun isn't showing it one bit.

1620
01:20:08,937 --> 01:20:10,706
Hang in there, Chaehyun!

1621
01:20:17,780 --> 01:20:18,981
[exclaiming]

1622
01:20:19,048 --> 01:20:20,215
Hey!

1623
01:20:21,617 --> 01:20:22,618
[Seungheon] They're trading now!

1624
01:20:22,685 --> 01:20:26,021
Kuk is coming forward
like there's nothing to think about.

1625
01:20:30,092 --> 01:20:31,260
{\an8}- [bell dings]
- Stop!

1626
01:20:31,327 --> 01:20:34,163
{\an8}And with that,
the sixth round comes to an end.

1627
01:20:34,229 --> 01:20:36,231
[audience cheering, applauding]

1628
01:20:39,601 --> 01:20:41,704
[Gyuwon] What these two fighters
are demonstrating

1629
01:20:42,204 --> 01:20:44,573
isn't just the art of boxing.

1630
01:20:45,341 --> 01:20:47,109
It's the art of sheer willpower.

1631
01:20:48,711 --> 01:20:52,147
- Chaehyun. Get me some ice!
- It's now Round 7,

1632
01:20:52,214 --> 01:20:53,916
so recovery is absolutely crucial.

1633
01:20:53,982 --> 01:20:57,920
- Lee Chaehyun! Lee Chaehyun!
- Lee Chaehyun! Lee Chaehyun!

1634
01:20:57,986 --> 01:20:59,288
Let's call over the doctor.

1635
01:21:00,255 --> 01:21:03,058
The headbutt is the problem.

1636
01:21:03,792 --> 01:21:05,494
[Dex] It looks pretty serious.

1637
01:21:06,028 --> 01:21:07,396
[spectator 1] You got this, Chaehyun!

1638
01:21:10,232 --> 01:21:12,868
- We can't let this go on much longer.
- [spectator 2] Let's go, Chaehyun!

1639
01:21:14,803 --> 01:21:18,340
[Lee] This was originally scheduled
as a 10-round fight,

1640
01:21:18,407 --> 01:21:22,678
but due to the significant cut
on Lee Chaehyun's eye,

1641
01:21:22,745 --> 01:21:27,349
we'll go to the scorecards
after the seventh round.

1642
01:21:27,416 --> 01:21:29,385
This round will be the last one.

1643
01:21:30,018 --> 01:21:32,888
[Chaehyun] <i>If I win this match,
I become the champion.</i>

1644
01:21:33,555 --> 01:21:35,424
<i>So I'm going to give it my all.</i>

1645
01:21:36,992 --> 01:21:38,227
Oh, Chaehyun...

1646
01:21:41,563 --> 01:21:43,265
[Chaehyun]
<i>I really want to become champion.</i>

1647
01:21:46,335 --> 01:21:47,870
[Seungjun] <i>This is the final round.</i>

1648
01:21:47,936 --> 01:21:51,073
<i>I won't let this fight
leave me with any regrets.</i>

1649
01:21:55,210 --> 01:21:57,813
Father, I'll bring back the win!

1650
01:21:59,348 --> 01:22:00,349
Sounds good!

1651
01:22:01,350 --> 01:22:02,484
[Seungjun] <i>I have to win.</i>

1652
01:22:02,551 --> 01:22:03,819
<i>I have to win no matter what.</i>

1653
01:22:03,886 --> 01:22:07,790
<i>I want to win
that champion belt for my parents.</i>

1654
01:22:09,558 --> 01:22:12,394
{\an8}[Seungheon] Who will become the winner
of the 300-million-won prize money?

1655
01:22:12,461 --> 01:22:14,329
{\an8}Who will walk away with the belt?

1656
01:22:24,807 --> 01:22:25,808
{\an8}[bell dings]

1657
01:22:25,874 --> 01:22:26,875
{\an8}LEE CHAEHYUN X KUK SEUNGJUN

1658
01:22:26,942 --> 01:22:28,477
{\an8}The final round has begun!

1659
01:22:28,544 --> 01:22:29,545
{\an8}Box!

1660
01:22:30,045 --> 01:22:31,346
{\an8}[Jongkook] Let's hear it for them!

1661
01:22:31,413 --> 01:22:32,848
{\an8}[audience cheering]

1662
01:22:32,915 --> 01:22:34,283
{\an8}[Seungheon] They're swinging for it now!

1663
01:22:34,349 --> 01:22:37,286
{\an8}[Gyuwon] We're seeing an intense exchange
of combinations right now.

1664
01:22:37,352 --> 01:22:40,088
Lee attempts to take away Kuk's space.

1665
01:22:40,155 --> 01:22:42,724
And Kuk is looking to overwhelm him!

1666
01:22:45,294 --> 01:22:47,296
[♪ intense music playing]

1667
01:22:53,268 --> 01:22:56,271
- Lee Chaehyun!
- Kuk Seungjun!

1668
01:22:56,905 --> 01:23:01,610
[Seungheon] Both fighters are throwing
with pure determination now!

1669
01:23:05,314 --> 01:23:06,482
Kuk closes in, swaying!

1670
01:23:06,548 --> 01:23:07,916
And Lee fires right back!

1671
01:23:08,750 --> 01:23:12,054
[Chaehyun] <i>As Seungjun's movements
got bigger, I started to see my timing.</i>

1672
01:23:12,120 --> 01:23:14,590
<i>So I decided to answer back
with proper counters.</i>

1673
01:23:14,656 --> 01:23:17,259
That's it. That was really good.

1674
01:23:24,032 --> 01:23:25,334
[Lee] Slip and rip!

1675
01:23:25,400 --> 01:23:27,069
Strike when he extends!

1676
01:23:27,135 --> 01:23:28,904
[Seungheon] Ooh! Sharp shot lands
right to the face!

1677
01:23:28,971 --> 01:23:31,206
[coach] Chaehyun, eyes on the chest!

1678
01:23:31,273 --> 01:23:32,474
The chest!

1679
01:23:33,242 --> 01:23:34,576
That's it!

1680
01:23:36,612 --> 01:23:37,746
[Seungheon] Kuk works the body.

1681
01:23:39,515 --> 01:23:40,782
Another one to the body!

1682
01:23:40,849 --> 01:23:42,584
That body shot landed clean.

1683
01:23:43,919 --> 01:23:45,153
[Dex] Solid body shot there.

1684
01:23:47,055 --> 01:23:48,790
[Seungjun] <i>When my body shot got through,</i>

1685
01:23:48,857 --> 01:23:51,126
<i>I could see him starting to tighten up.</i>

1686
01:23:54,196 --> 01:23:55,531
Whoa!

1687
01:23:55,597 --> 01:23:57,733
<i>I figured I'd drop him with a body shot.</i>

1688
01:23:57,799 --> 01:23:59,635
[coach] Pour it out! You've gotta go in!

1689
01:23:59,701 --> 01:24:00,836
[Seungheon] Kuk goes into the body!

1690
01:24:00,903 --> 01:24:02,204
Lee stops him with a clinch!

1691
01:24:02,271 --> 01:24:03,305
Break! Break!

1692
01:24:03,372 --> 01:24:05,007
[Seungheon] <i>Never seen
Chaehyun struggle so much.</i>

1693
01:24:07,709 --> 01:24:10,212
Throw back! You have to throw back!

1694
01:24:10,812 --> 01:24:14,550
Both fighters are squeezing out
every last ounce of strength!

1695
01:24:15,617 --> 01:24:17,119
- Break!
- [coach] Almost done!

1696
01:24:17,185 --> 01:24:18,186
Last round!

1697
01:24:20,022 --> 01:24:22,691
- Let's go, Chaehyun!
- Hang in there, Chaehyun!

1698
01:24:23,392 --> 01:24:25,494
Stay strong, Seungjun!

1699
01:24:25,561 --> 01:24:27,062
[Jongkook] One minute left!

1700
01:24:27,129 --> 01:24:32,868
- Lee Chaehyun! Lee Chaehyun!
- Kuk Seungjun! Kuk Seungjun!

1701
01:24:33,435 --> 01:24:34,703
[Seungheon] Kuk moves in.

1702
01:24:39,374 --> 01:24:40,776
This is it!

1703
01:24:40,842 --> 01:24:41,977
[Seungheon] Body shot again!

1704
01:24:42,044 --> 01:24:43,979
Lee Chaehyun lands a left to Kuk's face!

1705
01:24:45,080 --> 01:24:47,082
Kuk Seungjun fires the left hand again!

1706
01:24:50,018 --> 01:24:52,154
- Oh!
- [exclaiming]

1707
01:24:53,121 --> 01:24:55,757
[Gyuwon] The battle for space
is absolutely fierce right now!

1708
01:24:55,824 --> 01:24:57,960
Both are measuring the opening

1709
01:24:58,026 --> 01:25:00,262
to try and knock each other down.

1710
01:25:03,665 --> 01:25:05,567
{\an8}Go, go! You have to get him!

1711
01:25:06,134 --> 01:25:07,636
{\an8}Kuk lands one this time!

1712
01:25:08,270 --> 01:25:09,538
{\an8}A stick-and-move from Lee!

1713
01:25:11,106 --> 01:25:12,874
{\an8}- [bell dings]
- And with that!

1714
01:25:15,577 --> 01:25:16,912
The fight has ended!

1715
01:25:27,389 --> 01:25:28,924
You fought well!

1716
01:25:35,197 --> 01:25:38,634
[Lee] Both fighters
truly left it all in the ring.

1717
01:25:45,741 --> 01:25:47,242
Sorry.

1718
01:25:48,276 --> 01:25:49,611
Back to your positions.

1719
01:25:51,013 --> 01:25:52,080
Awesome fight!

1720
01:25:52,147 --> 01:25:53,749
This was originally a 10-round bout,

1721
01:25:53,815 --> 01:25:55,350
but in the interest of fighter safety,

1722
01:25:55,851 --> 01:25:57,619
the judges will render a fair decision

1723
01:25:58,420 --> 01:26:01,757
based on the first seven rounds.

1724
01:26:01,823 --> 01:26:04,559
Both fighters, great job.

1725
01:26:06,194 --> 01:26:08,263
You fought hard. For real.

1726
01:26:08,330 --> 01:26:09,331
Goodness.

1727
01:26:09,398 --> 01:26:11,233
You looked incredible up there.

1728
01:26:11,299 --> 01:26:12,300
You were the best.

1729
01:26:13,468 --> 01:26:14,736
Does your head hurt?

1730
01:26:14,803 --> 01:26:17,673
It's all good. You worked hard enough.

1731
01:26:19,741 --> 01:26:22,444
I thought, "Who's it going to be?"

1732
01:26:22,944 --> 01:26:24,646
I really couldn't tell who'd win.

1733
01:26:26,581 --> 01:26:28,984
<i>I just kept praying, "Please let me win."</i>

1734
01:26:31,687 --> 01:26:32,854
[exhales sharply]

1735
01:26:33,955 --> 01:26:37,793
[Chaehyun] <i>Even thinking back on it,
it felt like a razor-thin fight.</i>

1736
01:26:37,859 --> 01:26:39,661
<i>Waiting in the locker room,</i>

1737
01:26:40,395 --> 01:26:41,997
I was incredibly nervous.

1738
01:26:42,597 --> 01:26:45,600
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

1739
01:26:53,709 --> 01:26:55,644
[Lee]
The blockbuster boxing survival show.

1740
01:26:55,711 --> 01:26:56,812
<i>I Am Boxer.</i>

1741
01:26:57,312 --> 01:26:58,313
All that remains now

1742
01:26:58,980 --> 01:27:02,017
is the final winner announcement.

1743
01:27:12,027 --> 01:27:15,197
{\an8}[Jongkook] The decision was rendered by

1744
01:27:15,263 --> 01:27:17,265
{\an8}three of Korea's top judges.

1745
01:27:19,768 --> 01:27:23,238
[Dex] The championship belt,
top-of-the-line flagship SUV, and...

1746
01:27:24,506 --> 01:27:27,109
a grand prize of 300 million won

1747
01:27:28,477 --> 01:27:31,680
will go to the winner of <i>I Am Boxer</i>.

1748
01:27:34,249 --> 01:27:37,085
We will now announce the results

1749
01:27:37,819 --> 01:27:39,020
of the final match.

1750
01:27:39,654 --> 01:27:42,124
[Seungjun] <i>Man, I'm losing my mind.
What do I do?</i>

1751
01:27:42,190 --> 01:27:43,492
<i>My heart's about to explode.</i>

1752
01:27:44,860 --> 01:27:47,095
[Chaehyun] <i>"Please, please..."</i>

1753
01:27:47,162 --> 01:27:49,264
<i>That's all that was going through my head.</i>

1754
01:27:50,132 --> 01:27:52,567
Judge one scores the bout...

1755
01:27:54,336 --> 01:27:57,672
67 to 66...

1756
01:28:03,311 --> 01:28:04,412
{\an8}for Kuk Seungjun.

1757
01:28:04,479 --> 01:28:08,216
{\an8}JUDGE 1
BLUE CORNER KUK SEUNGJUN WINS

1758
01:28:16,057 --> 01:28:18,293
[Seungjun] <i>I was anxious the whole time,</i>

1759
01:28:18,360 --> 01:28:21,463
<i>but that gave me a bit of hope
that I could actually win this.</i>

1760
01:28:21,530 --> 01:28:24,266
Judge two scores the bout

1761
01:28:25,901 --> 01:28:27,803
68 to 65...

1762
01:28:33,141 --> 01:28:35,010
{\an8}for Lee Chaehyun.

1763
01:28:35,076 --> 01:28:39,347
{\an8}JUDGE 2
RED CORNER LEE CHAEHYUN WINS

1764
01:28:40,582 --> 01:28:42,150
[Chaehyun] <i>I was like, "Please, please..."</i>

1765
01:28:42,217 --> 01:28:44,586
<i>"Please let the second judge
score it for me."</i>

1766
01:28:51,393 --> 01:28:53,461
<i>I was insanely nervous.</i>

1767
01:28:54,229 --> 01:28:58,266
Lastly, Judge three scores the bout...

1768
01:28:58,867 --> 01:29:03,505
[Seungjun] <i>I kept screaming
inside my head, "Please call my name."</i>

1769
01:29:04,239 --> 01:29:07,809
[Chaehyun] <i>Since the winner's decided
by the third judge,</i>

1770
01:29:07,876 --> 01:29:11,580
<i>I just closed my eyes
and waited for the result.</i>

1771
01:29:17,352 --> 01:29:19,020
[Jongkook] Judge three scores the bout...

1772
01:29:23,258 --> 01:29:25,594
67 to 66...

1773
01:29:39,274 --> 01:29:40,542
{\an8}for Kuk Seungjun.

1774
01:29:40,609 --> 01:29:44,346
{\an8}JUDGE 3
BLUE CORNER KUK SEUNGJUN WINS

1775
01:29:44,412 --> 01:29:46,414
[♪ hopeful music playing]

1776
01:29:54,789 --> 01:29:57,859
The blockbuster boxing survival show,
<i>I Am Boxer</i>!

1777
01:29:57,926 --> 01:29:59,427
By judges' decision,

1778
01:30:00,962 --> 01:30:03,265
the champion is...

1779
01:30:06,368 --> 01:30:07,969
Kuk Seungjun!

1780
01:30:08,036 --> 01:30:13,775
{\an8}I AM BOXER
CHAMPION: KUK SEUNGJUN

1781
01:30:31,893 --> 01:30:33,395
Well done, Son.

1782
01:30:41,636 --> 01:30:45,340
Now, Master Don Lee will present

1783
01:30:45,407 --> 01:30:47,375
the championship belt to Kuk Seungjun.

1784
01:30:48,476 --> 01:30:50,111
Give it up for our champion.

1785
01:30:58,987 --> 01:31:00,755
You did great, my boy.

1786
01:31:02,390 --> 01:31:04,559
- Gosh, he did good.
- You were amazing.

1787
01:31:09,764 --> 01:31:11,466
I did it!

1788
01:31:20,976 --> 01:31:22,344
You did awesome.

1789
01:31:22,410 --> 01:31:23,845
You did so well.

1790
01:31:26,681 --> 01:31:28,083
Well done, Chaehyun!

1791
01:31:29,084 --> 01:31:30,986
- You did great, Chaehyun!
- Well fought!

1792
01:31:31,953 --> 01:31:34,823
- You put up a good fight, Chaehyun!
- You did great!

1793
01:31:40,729 --> 01:31:44,933
Now let's hear from Kuk Seungjun,

1794
01:31:45,000 --> 01:31:46,868
the champion of <i>I Am Boxer</i>.

1795
01:31:49,738 --> 01:31:51,706
Ever since I was a kid,

1796
01:31:52,474 --> 01:31:56,311
my father and I shared a dream.

1797
01:31:58,480 --> 01:31:59,914
The dream of becoming a champion.

1798
01:32:01,316 --> 01:32:02,951
Standing here today as champion...

1799
01:32:04,352 --> 01:32:08,023
I feel incredibly happy and overwhelmed.

1800
01:32:08,857 --> 01:32:14,129
I'd like to dedicate this belt
to my parents.

1801
01:32:15,663 --> 01:32:17,665
[♪ gentle music playing]

1802
01:32:18,400 --> 01:32:21,202
Our family has gone through a lot.

1803
01:32:22,303 --> 01:32:26,374
Honestly, we were once at a point
where we were talking about

1804
01:32:26,441 --> 01:32:28,943
<i>giving up on everything.</i>

1805
01:32:30,178 --> 01:32:31,679
<i>But after I started boxing,</i>

1806
01:32:32,514 --> 01:32:35,050
that kind of talk just disappeared.

1807
01:32:35,116 --> 01:32:36,518
Honestly, it was incredible.

1808
01:32:37,852 --> 01:32:38,953
So naturally,

1809
01:32:39,921 --> 01:32:42,924
I truly fell in love with boxing.

1810
01:32:44,459 --> 01:32:48,029
Now let's also hear from Lee Chaehyun,

1811
01:32:48,096 --> 01:32:50,331
who put up an incredible fight.

1812
01:32:51,433 --> 01:32:56,204
Of course,
it's disappointing that I didn't win.

1813
01:32:57,138 --> 01:33:02,177
But I believe the biggest reason
I'm standing here today is

1814
01:33:02,243 --> 01:33:06,014
because I stayed consistent
and kept working hard.

1815
01:33:07,148 --> 01:33:09,651
Even if boxers across the country

1816
01:33:09,717 --> 01:33:12,087
don't always get the results
they hope for,

1817
01:33:12,153 --> 01:33:15,390
I hope they keep going
steadily and sincerely.

1818
01:33:15,890 --> 01:33:21,162
And to my family,
who's supported me every step of the way,

1819
01:33:22,030 --> 01:33:23,031
I love you.

1820
01:33:27,469 --> 01:33:28,703
And lastly,

1821
01:33:29,471 --> 01:33:32,941
even in my next life,
I'd still choose boxing.

1822
01:33:34,976 --> 01:33:38,179
The blockbuster boxing survival show,
<i>I Am Boxer</i>.

1823
01:33:38,913 --> 01:33:41,883
We have come to the end
of its long journey.

1824
01:33:42,584 --> 01:33:47,489
To the fighters who will lead the future
of Korean boxing,

1825
01:33:47,555 --> 01:33:49,424
let's give them a big round of applause!

1826
01:33:51,693 --> 01:33:54,062
- Thank you!
- Thank you!

1827
01:33:54,929 --> 01:33:56,197
Great work, everyone.

1828
01:34:04,172 --> 01:34:05,807
- You fought well.
- You too.

1829
01:34:05,874 --> 01:34:06,875
Thanks.

1830
01:34:07,675 --> 01:34:09,110
All right.

1831
01:34:15,917 --> 01:34:18,486
[Seungjun] <i>Boxing was my salvation.</i>

1832
01:34:19,187 --> 01:34:21,523
[Chaehyun] <i>Boxing means everything to me.</i>

1833
01:34:21,589 --> 01:34:22,824
<i>It's my life.</i>

1834
01:34:23,725 --> 01:34:25,593
[Hyeongbin] <i>It feels like
two lives colliding.</i>

1835
01:34:25,660 --> 01:34:28,463
<i>That's the feeling I get with boxing.</i>

1836
01:34:29,297 --> 01:34:33,668
Through boxing,
I learned patience and perseverance,

1837
01:34:33,735 --> 01:34:36,037
<i>and I grew a lot as a person.</i>

1838
01:34:36,104 --> 01:34:38,606
<i>Boxing is like my lifelong companion.</i>

1839
01:34:38,673 --> 01:34:43,411
In times when I felt lost,
boxing was what saved me.

1840
01:34:43,478 --> 01:34:45,914
To me, boxing is

1841
01:34:45,980 --> 01:34:48,049
almost like a god.

1842
01:34:48,116 --> 01:34:51,319
Boxing is my life.

1843
01:34:51,386 --> 01:34:53,054
[in English] "No boxing, no life."

1844
01:34:53,121 --> 01:34:55,323
[in Korean] <i>That one phrase says it all.</i>

1845
